Comment: 10,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.25,0:00:20.63,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.63,0:00:21.58,Main,Girl,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:21.58,0:00:22.96,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,See you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.77,0:00:39.69,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Come in.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:41.40,0:00:42.77,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Oh, Sis!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.23,0:00:46.78,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Brought you some clean clothes.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.78,0:00:48.36,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,How’s your leg, Riku?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.36,0:00:51.20,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,It doesn’t hurt too badly, \N as long as I don’t move it too much.{Hyper literal: “It’s pretty okay as long as I don’t move it too intensely.” with the last word being https://jisho.org/search/%E6%BF%80%E3%81%97 -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.45,0:00:53.12,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.70,0:00:54.99,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Try to be careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:54.99,0:00:58.12,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Well, what about {\i1}your{\i0} leg?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:58.12,0:00:59.71,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Are you still running?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:59.71,0:01:02.08,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t be worrying \N about others right now.{Xemnas: The connotation here is that he should be taking care of himself rather than worrying about others. The previous translation was too aggressive and didn’t convey this very well}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.08,0:01:02.83,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Got it...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.83,0:01:06.84,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s right. You know about \N the Wind Festival in Fura City?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.84,0:01:08.51,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Yeah, I do.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:08.51,0:01:10.80,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,It’s a pretty big event, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.80,0:01:11.34,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:11.84,0:01:15.10,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,So, I wanted to ask you something...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.14,0:01:19.48,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I’m home...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.99,0:01:35.49,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,“Catch a Pokémon”?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.49,0:01:36.74,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,No way! No way! No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:36.74,0:01:38.66,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Please, I’m begging you!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.66,0:01:40.91,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I don’t wanna! \N Why would I do that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.91,0:01:43.71,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,I mean, look at my leg!
Comment: 10,0:01:43.71,0:01:51.59,Main,Riku,0,0,0,ALTERNATE HYPERLITERAL,Are you saying you’re okay with me pushing myself to go, collapsing while I’m out, thinking about my big sister as my mind fades, dying pathetically while completely unnoticed by those around me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.71,0:01:45.71,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,What if I forced myself to go \N and ended up collapsing?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:45.71,0:01:51.59,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,I’d just be lying there, unnoticed by those around me, \N thinking about you as I died a pitiful death...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:51.59,0:01:55.76,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,You’re heartless! Why was I cursed \N with such a cruel sister?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:55.76,0:01:59.27,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Oh, fine! You just want me \N to go there, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:59.27,0:02:00.73,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.73,0:02:03.10,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,I’m not asking you to do it \N for nothing, of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:03.10,0:02:03.98,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Here, take this.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:04.65,0:02:05.86,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:05.86,0:02:07.36,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,To show my gratitude.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:07.77,0:02:09.86,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Wear those to the festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.57,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,{\bord0\t(3194,3611,\blur15\c&HEEFDFF&)}They’re adorable! \N You really do have your moments! {Uh-oh, we got a sasuga, folks. -TLC}
Dialogue: 9,0:02:10.94,0:02:14.57,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,{\shad0.01\alpha&HFF&\4a&H00&\ko0\4c&H000000&\t(3194,3611,\blur15,\4c&HEEFDFF&)}They’re adorable! \N You really do have your moments! {Uh-oh, we got a sasuga, folks. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:02:17.70,0:02:19.33,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,A Pokémon, huh...?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.39,0:02:47.15,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,An award ceremony will be held to give the winner of \N the Pokémon Catching Contest a trophy.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.15,0:02:47.73,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:47.73,0:02:49.48,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.02,0:02:51.57,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Good morning, Largo.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:51.57,0:02:53.36,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Are you going \N to the Wind Festival today?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.32,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.32,0:02:55.82,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Take care of yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.82,0:02:57.28,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,You, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.66,0:03:01.49,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.70,0:03:39.91,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,This young man is \N Satoshi from Masara Town.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.91,0:03:45.33,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\q2}Together with his partner, Pikachu, \N he continues his journey to become a Pokémon Master.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:46.71,0:03:50.96,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,He now finds himself in the city that \N lives in harmony with the wind, Fura City.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.50,0:03:55.59,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,The Wind Festival is \N currently being held here.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.30,0:03:58.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Looks fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.73,0:04:08.19,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:08.64,0:04:10.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,There’s a bunch of \N even better stuff over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:12.02,0:04:14.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It looks really fluffy and delicious!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:15.40,0:04:18.86,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Huh... Didn’t think it’d be this festive.{Hyper literal: “Heeeh, it’s unexpectedly lively/festive/high-energy/ https://jisho.org/search/%E7%9B%9B%E3%82%8A%E4%B8%8A%E3%81%8C%E3%82%8B second definition”}
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.86,0:04:22.74,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose this isn’t half bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:24.16,0:04:26.54,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.54,0:04:29.62,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I swear, I can’t even \N look at the flowers in peace...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.62,0:04:30.71,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.67,0:04:35.25,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I-I can’t! I mean... It’s tomorrow!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:35.25,0:04:36.84,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,That’s... That’s just... But...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.84,0:04:37.97,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.97,0:04:40.01,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, yes, I’m fine...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.01,0:04:41.09,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Please don’t touch...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.09,0:04:43.89,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Um... Is there really \N no way you could...?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:43.89,0:04:44.72,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.85,0:04:49.81,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Lily, are you hurt?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:49.81,0:04:50.77,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I’m fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.77,0:04:52.27,Main,Lily's mom,0,0,0,,You should be more careful.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.27,0:04:54.77,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,But it’s all so much fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.77,0:04:55.61,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:55.61,0:04:58.61,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’ll take you somewhere \N even more fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.61,0:05:00.20,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,We’re gonna play all day!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.20,0:05:02.57,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Hooray! Uncle, you’re the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.64,0:05:28.60,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,PokéRan Channel!{Gurumin before Gurumin was a thing!!!}
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.60,0:05:31.23,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Everyone, it’s time \N for PokéRan Channel!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.23,0:05:37.23,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Today is the start of the annual \N Wind Festival held in Fura City!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:37.23,0:05:39.99,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,“Oh, how I wanted to go!”
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.99,0:05:44.28,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,To all you poor kids thinking that, \N I’m right there with you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.28,0:05:48.37,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Here on this channel, I’ll be giving you \N the latest news on the Wind Festival!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.91,0:05:52.96,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,They say the Wind Festival originates \N from a promise made with Lugia.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:52.96,0:05:56.04,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Apparently, this was once a barren land!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.04,0:05:59.96,Main,PokéRanPokéRan,0,0,0,,But the people and Pokémon \N lived by supporting one another!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:59.96,0:06:05.09,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,In honor of this bond, \N Lugia promised to bring the wind to this land!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.09,0:06:09.10,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,The people used this wind \N to develop the city!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.56,0:06:13.10,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,And now, Lugia stops by once a year!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:13.10,0:06:15.90,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,After seeing the bond between \N people and Pokémon for itself, {Literally “confirming/verifying the bond”}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:15.90,0:06:20.11,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Lugia sends a blessed wind \N upon this land, each and every year!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.11,0:06:23.15,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,And there’s another thing \N you should know about this city!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.15,0:06:28.28,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,There was a large wildfire in the past, \N and Lugia was the one who put it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.21,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.37,0:06:35.79,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,We bought ice cream!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.29,0:06:38.13,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Here, this one’s for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.13,0:06:40.63,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, thanks, Lily!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.13,0:06:45.38,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Say, say, can I see your Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.05,0:06:48.85,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Do you have \N a super strong Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.85,0:06:50.22,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, of course I do!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.64,0:06:51.27,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.27,0:06:52.81,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,What kind of Pokémon is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.60,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It’s the strongest Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.60,0:06:55.44,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Let me see!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.44,0:06:56.06,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.06,0:06:58.44,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, I mean, now’s not a good time...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.44,0:07:01.15,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It’s exhausted after a crazy battle \N I had the other day.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:01.15,0:07:03.15,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Lily, look! \N You’re about to drop your ice cream!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.15,0:07:04.61,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:05.11,0:07:07.70,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Thank you, big brother.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:07.70,0:07:10.20,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,She was completely set on \N coming to the Wind Festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.20,0:07:11.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Don’t mention it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.62,0:07:14.46,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,But is Lily... doing okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:14.46,0:07:17.50,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Yeah, she’s been \N quite healthy these days.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.38,0:07:23.30,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Say, say, Uncle, \N what’s that Pokémon called?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:23.30,0:07:27.05,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s \N the Legendary Pokémon, Lugia.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.51,0:07:30.39,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,This city became big thanks to it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:30.39,0:07:33.14,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Wow! Uncle, you know so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.14,0:07:35.35,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It’s a tale from a time long gone by...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:35.35,0:07:37.10,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It happened on a cold day.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.77,0:07:40.69,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,My work had brought me to this city.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.69,0:07:41.82,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,And then...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.82,0:07:44.65,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I saw a red light shining \N in the distant mountains!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:45.07,0:07:47.86,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I realized, it must be a wildfire!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.86,0:07:51.16,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I shouted, \N “The fire’s getting closer to the city!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.16,0:07:54.16,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,“Everyone, get outta here!”
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.16,0:07:57.16,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I called out to Lugia, \N and prayed for it to save us.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.16,0:08:00.46,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Then Lugia answered my prayers \N and put out the fire!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:00.46,0:08:04.42,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,And thus, the city was saved!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.42,0:08:07.26,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,And everyone lived \N happily ever after.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.26,0:08:08.97,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,{\an8}I’m so sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:07.26,0:08:09.39,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Uncle, you’re the best!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.39,0:08:11.14,Main,Kagachi & Lily,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.14,0:08:13.14,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Oh, come on... \N You and your lies...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.14,0:08:15.47,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I wasn’t lying. \N It was just... {\i1}creative liberties.{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.47,0:08:17.27,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Come on, Lily.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.27,0:08:20.35,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Where do you wanna go next? \N That place over there looks fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.35,0:08:21.40,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah, let’s go!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.40,0:08:24.69,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,If only I could speak in front of people \N the way he does, too...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.11,0:08:29.53,Main,Kid C,0,0,0,,Lemonade! Lemonade!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.24,0:08:32.20,Main,Kid C,0,0,0,,Would you like some lemonade?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.37,0:08:33.99,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,Gomazo!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.99,0:08:34.91,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.25,0:08:41.00,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,What’s this thing’s problem?! \N Keep it away from me!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.34,Main,Kid A and B,0,0,0,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:54.68,0:08:56.97,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Didn’t you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.97,0:08:59.64,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,That old lady’s \N a known Pokémon-hater!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.64,0:09:00.52,Main,Kid C,0,0,0,,What? Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.35,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Hey, don’t let go!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.11,0:09:05.82,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Did you see her hands? \N She’s wearing gloves! In the {\i1}summer!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:07.86,0:09:08.40,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.40,0:09:08.90,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Largo!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.90,0:09:09.70,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I’m sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:09.70,0:09:11.45,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,That’s the mayor’s daughter, \N you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.03,0:09:15.12,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Look what you’ve done!{What SHE’S done?! Kid, I’m way more upset with you guys for talking over each other so much, making the timing of this scene an unfixable mess no matter how you spin it... -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:15.12,0:09:17.58,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,We can’t make any more \N lemonade now, you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:17.91,0:09:19.66,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I-I’m sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:19.66,0:09:21.42,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But I have somewhere I need to—
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.42,0:09:23.08,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:23.50,0:09:24.88,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Pay us back!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:28.80,0:09:30.22,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.59,0:09:34.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s a festival, after all! \N You should be nice to each other!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.89,0:09:38.18,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Wh-Who’re you supposed to be?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.18,0:09:40.35,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,Get ‘em! Gomazo, Rollout!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.31,0:09:42.60,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Dodge!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.31,0:09:45.36,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.11,0:09:48.73,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Amazing...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:48.73,0:09:49.86,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Use Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:52.11,0:09:54.28,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,Gomazo, use Tackle!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.79,0:10:01.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,He’s asking if you wanna keep going!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.33,0:10:04.38,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,W-We’ll let you off the hook \N for today, you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.38,0:10:06.25,Main,Kid C,0,0,0,,C’mon, we’re leaving!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.25,0:10:08.63,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,We’ll get you for this!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.63,0:10:10.80,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.80,0:10:12.72,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t mention it. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.68,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Yup! Thanks to you, too, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.39,0:10:19.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’m Satoshi from Masara Town. \N This is my partner, Pikachu.{Intentionally reduced the lead-out here because otherwise the subtitle would cover pretty much ALL of Poi’s “Pikachu!”-ing.}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.14,0:10:22.69,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,My name is Largo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.69,0:10:24.44,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Did you come here for the Wind Festival?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:24.44,0:10:26.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yup. That’s right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.77,0:10:28.94,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Quite impressive.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:28.94,0:10:31.49,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Yeah! He handled that like a pro!{Rewriting this a bit so that it DOESN’T sound quite as much like Kojiro is seeing Pikachu for the first time. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:31.49,0:10:34.36,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,What’ll we do for our next \N Pikachu capture plan, meow?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.36,0:10:35.66,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I’ve made up my mind...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.66,0:10:37.49,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We’ll start selling juice, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:37.49,0:10:38.99,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Time to put our skills to the test...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.99,0:10:40.79,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Well, then let’s not waste time and...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.79,0:10:42.04,Main,Kojiro & Nyarth,0,0,0,,...Sell {\i1}juice?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.04,0:10:44.33,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,There’s lots of people around.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.33,0:10:50.59,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We could cause a big juice boom \N and really rake in the cash!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.59,0:10:53.76,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,F-Fair point, \N but what about Pikachu?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:53.76,0:10:54.93,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,What do you think, Nyarth?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.89,0:10:59.93,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We should get right to work, meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.60,Main,Sohnansu,0,0,0,,Sohnansu!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.72,0:11:02.60,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}That’s right!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.98,0:11:04.89,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Does that mean \N we’ll get to meet Lugia?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.89,0:11:07.02,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Yup. On the last day of the festival.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.61,0:11:09.48,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,It’s the Wind Festival’s main event!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.48,0:11:11.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:11.36,0:11:13.49,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Ah! Look!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.49,0:11:14.86,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,That’s the Sacred Flame!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.57,0:11:19.28,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Lugia uses it {literally “that Sacred Flame” but she literally JUST said its name and that kind of repetition feels way more awkward in English than in Japanese. -TLC}as a marker \N to send the wind to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.62,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I see... So what’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:21.62,0:11:23.75,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,The old power plant.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.75,0:11:30.09,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,From what I hear, it was damaged in the wildfire \N fifty years ago and isn’t being used anymore.{Really? Because it just looks SO active... -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:30.09,0:11:32.25,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But back during that fire,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.25,0:11:34.63,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Lugia made the rain fall \N and saved everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.63,0:11:36.84,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lugia’s awesome!{Xemnas: Haven’t you already met Lugia... TWICE!!!}{AU, man. That didn’t happen to THIS version of Satoshi. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.89,0:11:40.05,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Well, I’m going this way.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:40.05,0:11:42.06,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,The Wind Festival venue is over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.06,0:11:43.85,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Got it. Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.85,0:11:44.68,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Later!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.68,0:11:46.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,See ya!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.98,0:11:55.57,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.57,0:11:59.87,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you all so much!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.32,0:11:59.87,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}Congratulations! Here’s your prize.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.87,0:12:01.12,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.58,0:12:02.74,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Here you go, Lily.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.74,0:12:05.37,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Yay! Thank you, Uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.37,0:12:07.16,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, it was a piece of cake!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.16,0:12:08.12,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,How nice!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.12,0:12:12.75,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Since you won it for me, \N I’ll cherish it forever and ever!{This doll you won for me \N will be my treasure!}{Okay. So I’m trying to make her dialogue actually read like a kid’s... But this does not sound much like something a kid would say. This needs work. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.30,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:17.30,0:12:19.34,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Yeah... I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.34,0:12:21.22,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,I am so sorry! Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:21.22,0:12:22.35,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,No, I’m fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.72,0:12:24.85,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,It’s my fault for \N not paying attention.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.19,0:12:29.98,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Where’s your Pokémon, lady?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.98,0:12:31.69,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Oh, this?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.69,0:12:33.36,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I actually came to this city \N to catch one,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.36,0:12:36.57,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,but it must be mega rare! \N I can’t find it anywhere!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.57,0:12:39.07,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,You should ask Uncle, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.07,0:12:39.66,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.66,0:12:41.91,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,He’s an amazing Pokémon Trainer!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.91,0:12:42.62,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.62,0:12:45.16,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Well, please tell me, then!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.16,0:12:47.58,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Um... What Pokémon do you want?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.29,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,This one.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.29,0:12:53.50,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, that? \N Yeah, that one’s mega rare, all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.50,0:12:56.51,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,What? Really? \N Where can I find it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:56.51,0:12:58.72,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Well, you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.72,0:12:59.80,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.80,0:13:01.14,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,There! It’s over there!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.55,0:13:04.01,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I got info saying it’s \N on that mountain!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.43,0:13:07.10,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Really? Thank you so much, Mister!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.10,0:13:08.02,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Sure...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.73,0:13:18.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Now you’ve done it, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:20.78,0:13:26.62,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,The Wind Festival’s annual Catching Contest \N will begin shortly on Main Street.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.62,0:13:30.41,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,All Pokémon Trainers, \N please feel free to participate.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.41,0:13:32.29,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.13,0:13:36.59,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Did you hear that, Uncle? \N The Catching Contest! You should enter!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:36.59,0:13:37.13,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Uh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.59,0:13:39.09,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I’m sure you can win!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.09,0:13:41.68,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Sure! Leave it to Uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.68,0:13:44.43,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’m a {\i1}great{\i0} Pokémon Trainer, after all!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:44.43,0:13:49.06,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’ll beat all those other tough guys and \N give you the victory trophy as a present!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.69,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Really? Yay!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:52.31,0:13:53.81,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Oh, come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.15,0:13:59.82,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,The presenter isn’t coming?!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.82,0:14:01.11,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,What are you gonna do, Torito?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.11,0:14:02.78,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I-I’ll fix it, somehow...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.78,0:14:04.82,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,“Somehow” isn’t good enough!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.58,0:14:09.75,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,The presentation is tomorrow. \N How can you find someone on such short notice?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.08,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,You should put a bit more faith in u—
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.08,0:14:13.33,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I-It’s fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.25,0:14:16.29,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’ll work it out on my own... \N Somehow...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.04,0:14:19.67,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,This is our chance to let the world \N know about our research.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:19.67,0:14:22.84,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,I’m sure you, too, know how important \N this presentation is.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.26,0:14:26.10,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.85,0:14:34.44,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,{\an8}Win, huh...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:32.27,0:14:33.60,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.60,0:14:35.77,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,It says it’s \N the Pokémon research pavilion!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.19,0:14:38.94,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Pokémon research, is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.57,Main,Kid,0,0,0,,No, you got it wrong!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:43.07,0:14:45.16,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Are there any doctors around here?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:45.74,0:14:48.58,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, yes. I’m here.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.03,0:14:53.62,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Has the heat finally cooked my brain?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.62,0:14:55.21,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,N-No, you’re quite sane.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:58.42,0:15:00.88,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m so sorry! \N Are your clothes all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.88,0:15:01.55,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.55,0:15:04.76,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,But don’t just pop \N out of nowhere like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.76,0:15:06.22,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Are you trying to kill me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:06.22,0:15:07.34,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, no, not at all...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.34,0:15:09.76,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Here. I need you to sign this.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.22,0:15:11.97,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Hand it over to the Executive Committee.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.97,0:15:13.23,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh... Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.23,0:15:14.39,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I swear...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.94,0:15:16.19,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m very sorry, Miss.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.48,0:15:22.78,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Hey, you! \N You a Pokémon researcher?{Intentional slang-ification.}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.15,0:15:26.24,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,That means you know a lot \N about Pokémon, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.86,0:16:04.28,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,You two get this.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.57,0:16:06.40,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Eat up.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.37,0:16:13.37,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I’m sorry you were hurt \N because of me.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.16,0:16:17.50,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,If you eat these Oran Berries, \N you’ll get better faster. So eat all of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.46,0:16:22.63,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I’ll be back later.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:36.18,0:16:38.39,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Whoa... \N Look at all these people!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:38.39,0:16:40.77,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,You can do it, Uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.52,0:16:44.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of \N Pokémon we’ll find!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.44,0:16:46.61,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Isn’t this cool, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:47.40,0:16:48.95,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Lum Berry juice!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.95,0:16:50.32,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Perfect for the Catching Contest!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:50.32,0:16:52.74,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Would you like some Lum Berry juice?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.74,0:16:55.24,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Lum Berries are \N very healthy for Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.24,0:16:56.75,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Paralysis, sleep, confusion...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:56.75,0:17:01.04,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We’ve made juice out of these super special{awesome -TLC} berries \N that can cure any condition, meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.13,0:17:05.88,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,It’s finally time for \N the Wind Festival’s annual Catching Contest!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:05.88,0:17:07.55,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The rules are simple:
Dialogue: 10,0:17:07.55,0:17:12.72,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Marked Pokémon are spread throughout \N the streets of Fura City, waiting for the participants!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.72,0:17:16.27,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,But they’re all tough Pokémon \N who won’t just {\i1}let{\i0} themselves be caught!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.27,0:17:19.02,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,This will be no easy task!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.02,0:17:24.36,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,All contestants, please use the exclusive balls \N we’ve provided for you to catch these Pokémon!{There’s something funky about the audio in the word “sankasha”... -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:17:24.36,0:17:27.11,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,You’ll be given points based on \N the level of the Pokémon you catch!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.11,0:17:32.20,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Whoever claims the most points \N before time runs out will be the winner!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.20,0:17:34.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Testing, testing... \N Can you hear me? Over.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.66,0:17:39.20,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Yes, I can hear you just fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:39.20,0:17:43.63,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,{\q2}Mr. Kagachi{honorific note: Kagachi-san}, you {\i1}will{\i0} help me with the presentation \N if I help you here, won’t you?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.63,0:17:46.96,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Duh. It’s a win-win for both of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.96,0:17:48.80,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,So don’t let me down, Doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:48.80,0:17:49.88,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:49.88,0:17:53.76,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, and please don’t push \N my Hitodeman too hard.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:53.76,0:17:54.72,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.72,0:17:56.76,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Well then, let’s get to it!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:56.76,0:17:58.18,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Ready...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.18,0:17:59.60,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Get!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:59.60,0:18:01.35,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:05.81,0:18:08.61,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s get ourselves some awesome Pokémon! \N We’re gonna win this!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:10.32,0:18:11.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s an Arbo!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.07,0:18:13.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.37,0:18:19.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.67,0:18:26.67,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right! That’s the first one!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.51,0:18:32.88,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,It’s so tough!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.23,0:18:45.90,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The participants keep on \N catching Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.90,0:18:48.23,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The one performing the best so far...{Torn on whether this should bleed or not. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.23,0:18:49.73,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,...is Competitor Kagachi!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.73,0:18:52.11,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Go, Uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.11,0:18:57.41,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,He’s making superb use of Hitodeman’s ability, \N Luminescence{はっこう / Illuminate. Presumably from 発光}, which causes Pokémon to approach it! {Marking this in case the ability’s JP name is different. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.17,0:19:14.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, did you see that?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.39,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Right! Let’s chase it!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.06,0:19:21.64,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,This is rough...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.64,0:19:24.10,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,It’s going perfectly! \N You’re in first place right now!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.10,0:19:26.48,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,This is hopeless...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.65,0:19:35.28,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,What is that thing doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.16,0:19:49.84,Main,Usokki,0,0,0,,Uso! Uso Uso!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.16,0:19:49.84,Main,TL Note,0,0,0,,{\c0\3c&HFFFFFF}{\fscx80\fscy80\blur4.5\pos(960,957)}Lies!/You’re kidding me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.38,0:19:55.47,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Mr. Kagachi{honorific note: Kagachi-san}, Usokki is \N weak against Water!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.47,0:19:56.76,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is your chance!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:57.34,0:20:02.06,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Oh, my! I just received word that \N Banguirus is rampaging through the city,
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.06,0:20:04.39,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,and that Competitor Satoshi \N is in pursuit of it!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.39,0:20:08.98,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Um... It appears that Banguirus’s neck \N became entangled in wires!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:08.15,0:20:08.98,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,{\an8}No way...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.19,0:20:14.82,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Banguirus!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.78,0:20:20.87,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, can you \N lead Banguirus over there?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:22.49,0:20:24.04,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you, partner!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.90,0:20:56.19,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You shouldn’t lie \N to yourself so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.19,0:20:57.44,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It’ll become a habit.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:57.99,0:21:00.78,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Mimicry is what Usokki is {\i1}known{\i0} for.{Literally “That’s a Pokémon whose defining trait is mimicry.” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.78,0:21:02.16,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Can it!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.16,0:21:04.49,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Tell me where the next \N Pokémon is, already.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.23,0:21:35.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Now I’ve got you, Banguirus!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.65,0:21:38.32,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,This is bad! There’s a large crowd \N in front of Banguirus!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.32,0:21:39.65,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,They’re in trouble!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.66,0:21:44.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, it’s all on you now!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.20,0:21:46.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Use Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:53.63,0:21:54.83,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Banguirus!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:56.96,0:22:00.01,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah, don’t worry. \N You’re safe now.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:00.01,0:22:01.80,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Well done, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.34,0:22:06.30,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Spectacular! Competitor Satoshi \N has saved Banguirus!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:06.30,0:22:09.81,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,A friendship that transcends catching Pokémon! \N It’s burning hot!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.81,0:22:10.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Can you stand?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.40,0:22:19.94,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,The second place winner, and the man who \N saved Banguirus, Competitor Satoshi...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.94,0:22:22.61,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,...gets the Mayor’s Prize.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.61,0:22:24.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.03,0:22:27.45,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I’m the one who should be thanking you, \N for saving Banguirus.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.03,0:22:30.12,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I had Pikachu with me,
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.12,0:22:31.37,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,so I thought I could do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:32.04,0:22:33.54,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s all thanks to him!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:35.04,0:22:37.88,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,And the winner of the contest...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:37.88,0:22:39.30,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,...is Competitor Kagachi!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.30,0:22:40.88,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I did it, Lily!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:41.30,0:22:43.55,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Uncle, you’re so cool!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:46.30,0:22:49.01,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Congratulations on coming first \N in the Catching Contest!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:49.01,0:22:50.14,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:50.14,0:22:53.06,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It was no big deal for \N someone as great as me!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:53.06,0:22:56.48,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,Incidentally, are there any Pokémon \N you’d like to get next?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.48,0:22:57.73,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:01.36,0:23:04.99,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I understand there’s supposed to be \N a super rare Pokémon around here...{Kagachi just unintentionally causing EVERY SINGLE SOLITARY THING THAT GOES WRONG FOR THE ENTIRE REST OF THE MOVIE :D -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:04.99,0:23:07.24,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,What? Is that so?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:07.24,0:23:08.95,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,A super rare Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.95,0:23:13.25,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Since I’m here at the Wind Festival \N anyway, I’d love to get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.25,0:23:14.37,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Did you know?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.37,0:23:14.87,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:13.71,0:23:14.87,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}I wanna get it!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:14.87,0:23:17.00,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I wonder what kind of Pokémon \N it could be!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.29,0:23:21.84,Main,Announcer,0,0,0,,That was our winner, \N Competitor Kagachi, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:21.84,0:23:23.26,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Thanks a bunch!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:24.22,0:23:26.18,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,PokéRan Channel!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.18,0:23:29.39,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,We just got some juicy info!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:29.39,0:23:32.93,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,It seems a super rare Pokémon \N can be found in Fura City!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:32.93,0:23:37.06,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,No Pokémon Trainer can let \N this chance pass them by, can they?!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.54,0:23:54.20,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Was I hearing things?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.04,0:24:02.17,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I wanna keep playing with Uncle...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.17,0:24:03.63,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,She’s sleep-talking.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:03.63,0:24:06.72,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,She’s been running around all day. \N She must have had fun.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:06.72,0:24:08.47,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,That’s the most important thing.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.43,0:24:10.51,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Anyway...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.51,0:24:12.35,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Why are {\i1}you{\i0} following me around?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.77,0:24:16.85,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Don’t you “Usso” me! {Is this supposed to be “Uso” or is it correct? - Toa}{This is correct. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:24:16.85,0:24:18.94,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I gave back all \N the Pokémon I caught earlier!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.94,0:24:21.31,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Heck, I didn’t even \N {\i1}catch{\i0} you in the first place!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:22.19,0:24:25.74,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,What? You followed my brother \N because you like him?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:27.78,0:24:29.24,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Leave me alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:29.24,0:24:32.03,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,What do I care what somebody \N like {\i1}you{\i0} thinks of me?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:36.66,0:24:38.67,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Were you even listening to me?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:42.09,0:24:43.59,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,How was the Wind Festival?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:43.59,0:24:45.17,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Yup! It was really fun!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:45.17,0:24:48.34,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I rode the roller coaster, \N went to the haunted house...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:48.34,0:24:49.59,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:49.59,0:24:52.22,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,It was a lot of work today, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:52.22,0:24:57.43,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,That man who won the Catching Contest said \N there’s a rare Pokémon in this city...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:58.81,0:25:02.11,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,He must have been joking! \N I’ve never heard of anything like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:02.81,0:25:05.78,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Um... What about the one \N from the stories{“iitsutae”... I’m half-tempted to use “myths”, were it not for the fact that, while Zeraora IS classified as a Mythical Pokémon, the Japanese term for that is “maboroshi”. -TLC}... Zeraora?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:05.78,0:25:09.15,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Largo, that Pokémon \N doesn’t exist anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:09.53,0:25:10.32,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:11.82,0:25:16.12,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We mustn’t scare the citizens. \N So don’t say anything strange.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:16.58,0:25:17.79,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:23.46,0:25:26.46,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Sheesh... Where is that thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:30.72,0:25:32.68,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Don’t scare me like that!{Don’t just move so abruptly!}{Blah. Not an awesome line. Also I somehow feel like I SHOULD find this scene funnier than I actually do. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:25:33.93,0:25:35.85,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Ow...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:35.85,0:25:39.14,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,You there! \N This mountain is off-limits!
Dialogue: 10,0:25:40.02,0:25:42.15,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Don’t you know about \N Zeraora’s Curse?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:42.77,0:25:46.11,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,H-Hang on... \N Zeraora? Curse?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:46.44,0:25:48.36,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Are you a tourist?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:48.36,0:25:50.99,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,In any case, you can’t be on this mountain! \N Now, come with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:25:50.99,0:25:54.07,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I-I get it, but just \N tell me something first...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:54.07,0:25:56.66,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,This Pokémon is \N supposed to be super rare...
Dialogue: 10,0:25:56.66,0:25:57.95,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Do you know it?
Dialogue: 10,0:25:57.95,0:26:01.37,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Super rare? \N That’s just an ordinary Eevee.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:01.37,0:26:02.87,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,They don’t live on this mountain.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:04.54,0:26:07.30,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That old geezer lied to me!{Her half-kinda-sorta scream before this totally sounds like “Shiiiit!”... -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:09.67,0:26:12.88,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,What’s with you?! \N Where’d you come from?!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:17.43,0:26:19.43,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Don’t you {\i1}dare{\i0} touch {\i1}this!{\i0}{Literally “Don’t touch just this one thing” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:26:22.14,0:26:23.69,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Stay away from me!
Dialogue: 10,0:26:34.82,0:26:36.99,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Well done, Hitodeman.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:37.99,0:26:41.12,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, \N I should be fine tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:46.88,0:26:50.26,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,He was an excellent public speaker.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:50.26,0:26:53.17,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m sure he’ll do well.
Dialogue: 10,0:26:53.17,0:26:56.22,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Nyarth, what’s that guy researching?
Dialogue: 10,0:26:56.22,0:26:57.85,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Hmmm...
Dialogue: 10,0:26:58.22,0:27:01.56,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Looks like it’s Pokémon \N abilities and moves, meow.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:01.56,0:27:02.81,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,That’s great!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:02.81,0:27:05.65,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I don’t really get it, \N but I’m sure it’ll be useful!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:12.61,0:27:15.24,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Well then, \N let’s go grab it right away!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:15.24,0:27:16.24,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:19.16,0:27:21.66,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I-Is somebody there?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:27.71,0:27:28.88,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Hold on, everyone...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:33.34,0:27:35.59,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, is {\i1}this{\i0} what made the noise?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:35.59,0:27:38.18,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Everyone, watch out for \N shards of glass.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:39.47,0:27:42.02,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is the chemical \N made from Doble ink.
Dialogue: 10,0:27:43.31,0:27:45.27,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Did it slide off the table?
Dialogue: 10,0:27:49.56,0:27:50.65,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,That was close!
Dialogue: 10,0:27:50.65,0:27:51.69,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I panicked...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:51.69,0:27:54.07,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,We’ll try again tomorrow, meow...
Dialogue: 10,0:27:59.07,0:28:04.37,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,There might be a Pokémon we know nothing about \N somewhere in this city, Pikachu!{Candidate for maybe re-edit? Literally “Somewhere in this city, there might be a Pokémon we still don’t know, huh, Pikachu?” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:28:19.93,0:28:24.06,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Oh, that’s right. I slept outside \N because of those things.
Dialogue: 10,0:28:35.36,0:28:37.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What are we gonna do today, \N Pikachu?
Dialogue: 10,0:28:49.92,0:28:51.33,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 10,0:28:51.33,0:28:52.13,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What the...?!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:00.43,0:29:01.97,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu says he’s sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:01.97,0:29:04.14,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Don’t worry about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:04.14,0:29:08.18,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I’m just happy to be getting help from \N the runner-up in the Catching Contest!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:08.18,0:29:09.64,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s really not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:09.64,0:29:12.98,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,On the flipside, \N the {\i1}winner{\i0} fed me a bunch of lies! {Suggesting “flipside” in place of “other hand”. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:12.98,0:29:13.65,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Shhh!{Added because both continuing Risa’s line over this sound AND interrupting it with nothing seemed weird. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:18.82,0:29:20.95,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Great work, Pikachu.
Dialogue: 10,0:29:27.00,0:29:28.58,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That’s the one!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:28.58,0:29:30.62,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,If you wanna catch it, \N you gotta battle it first!{Unless you’re playing Let’s Go (In stores now!!) which I feel like Eevee’s involvement was a deliberate marketing ploy for! -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:29:30.62,0:29:31.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Risa, where’s your Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:31.96,0:29:33.46,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Uh? Don’t have one...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:33.46,0:29:34.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 10,0:29:34.59,0:29:36.84,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Right! Pikachu, can you help her?
Dialogue: 10,0:29:37.88,0:29:40.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Okay, and now... \N We’re jumping right in! { https://jisho.org/search/%E3%81%B6%E3%81%A3%E3%81%A4%E3%81%91%E6%9C%AC%E7%95%AA }
Dialogue: 10,0:29:42.01,0:29:43.30,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,What? You’re kidding!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:47.10,0:29:48.31,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:52.69,0:29:54.31,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:55.36,0:29:56.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:56.44,0:29:58.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Listen up! \N Keep a close eye on Eevee!
Dialogue: 10,0:29:58.99,0:30:00.53,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Right, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:01.99,0:30:03.82,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Pikachu, dodge!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:05.07,0:30:06.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Risa! Use Lightning Speed!{Ah, the redundancy. Satoshi commanding Risa to command Poi to use attack. Anyway it might be worth to have him word it differently than a usual attack command since he’s technically telling HER to issue the commands? Though all the ways I can think of to implement that feel weird. “Say Lightning Speed!” “Call out Lightning Speed!” Yeah idk that I’m really feeling those. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:30:06.70,0:30:08.12,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:14.17,0:30:16.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Now! Throw the Monster Ball!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:16.34,0:30:17.63,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Right, got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:30:19.34,0:30:20.26,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:28.93,0:30:29.77,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,So close!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:29.77,0:30:30.98,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,One more time!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:30.98,0:30:31.77,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:35.90,0:30:37.07,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Use Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:37.07,0:30:38.82,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:42.03,0:30:43.45,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Use 100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:43.45,0:30:44.41,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:52.54,0:30:53.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:53.50,0:30:54.25,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 10,0:30:54.87,0:30:56.71,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:08.93,0:31:10.64,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You did it, Risa!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:10.64,0:31:12.64,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Huh? You mean I got it?
Dialogue: 10,0:31:12.64,0:31:13.73,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:15.85,0:31:20.40,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I did it! I did it! I got Eevee!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:21.19,0:31:23.36,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Thank you, Satoshi, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:24.78,0:31:26.49,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Wh-Where are your eyebrows?!{Literally Mugi over here. Well except not quite because it looks like Risa’s eyebrows are mostly makeup whereas Mugi’s are, as we all know, takuan pickles. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:31:33.08,0:31:34.08,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I’m back.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:36.29,0:31:38.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hey, you should let Eevee out!
Dialogue: 10,0:31:38.33,0:31:39.00,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:49.22,0:31:51.47,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I’m Risa. Let’s be friends.
Dialogue: 10,0:31:53.93,0:31:56.31,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. \N It’ll warm up to you before long.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:03.99,0:32:07.24,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That was the first time I’ve ever \N caught a Pokémon. It was so exciting!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:07.24,0:32:08.53,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,It was, like, how can I put it...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:08.53,0:32:10.58,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I haven’t been so fired up \N about anything in {\i1}ages!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:10.58,0:32:12.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah. It’s nice, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:12.70,0:32:16.21,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Ever since I was little, \N I’ve been focused on running track,
Dialogue: 10,0:32:16.21,0:32:18.54,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,so I never even learned \N {\i1}how{\i0} to catch Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:18.54,0:32:20.50,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,So you’re fast, then?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:20.50,0:32:24.51,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Yup! I might not look it, \N but I’m the regional champion!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:24.51,0:32:25.97,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 10,0:32:26.51,0:32:27.63,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:27.63,0:32:28.76,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,...gave it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:28.76,0:32:29.93,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:30.55,0:32:34.39,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I got injured. \N It’s long since healed up, but...
Dialogue: 10,0:32:36.52,0:32:38.81,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Suddenly, \N the thought of running scared me.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:44.86,0:32:48.07,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I think with Eevee by your side, \N you’ll be able to run again.
Dialogue: 10,0:32:48.07,0:32:49.28,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Huh? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:32:49.78,0:32:50.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I mean...{31:49.78 / 1:10:33.61}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:50.99,0:32:53.66,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I kinda feel like, even if there are things \N we can’t do on our own,{32:50.99 / 1:10:35.15}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:53.66,0:32:56.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,anything’s possible if we’ve \N got Pokémon with us.{32:53.66 / 1:10:37.86}
Dialogue: 10,0:32:59.46,0:33:00.63,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That’s so cheesy!{Bit of a liberal translation here, but I feel it matches the intent better... and it DEFINITELY matches the intent better when she later has the same reaction to Satoshi’s “Pokémon Power” spiel. -TLC}{For the record, the literal is “What’s that about?” but yeah, the tone is more “lol that’s silly. You’re silly.” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:06.05,0:33:08.88,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Ms. Junsa{honorific note: Junsa-san}? \N Has there been a crime?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:10.97,0:33:12.39,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Hey, Doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:33:13.51,0:33:17.60,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Wh-What brings you here \N so early in the morning?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:17.60,0:33:20.35,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,What’s the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:21.56,0:33:24.40,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,“This”... \N You mean the Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:33:24.40,0:33:27.99,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,They’ve been strangely clingy \N ever since I went here yesterday.{Literally “Ever since I came here yesterday, behavior has been strange.” ORIGINALLY this said “They’ve been acting strange” but then it got changed to “Strange things have been happening to me” because Hisui would not know the normal behavior of these Pokémon since she’s never met them before... But yeah no, she IS commenting on the Pokémon’s behavior. So, slightly embellished to say WHAT’s strange about their behavior. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:27.99,0:33:35.41,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh... The chemical that spilled yesterday \N was based off the Pokémon move Sweet Scent. {I’m pretty sure this move’s name is a literal translation, but marking all the same. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:35.41,0:33:38.29,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,It’s a move that emits a scent that Pokémon like, \N which causes them to gather...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:39.00,0:33:41.67,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Why would you even {\i1}make{\i0} \N such a lousy drug?!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:41.67,0:33:43.96,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I don’t want anything to do \N with Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:44.46,0:33:46.63,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Hurry up and fix this!{Hyper literally: “Hurry and remove its effect!” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:33:46.63,0:33:49.51,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,B-But that’s... I need time...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:50.26,0:33:51.38,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:51.76,0:33:52.89,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Bad news!
Dialogue: 10,0:33:52.89,0:33:55.18,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,I just got word from \N the festival administration...
Dialogue: 10,0:33:58.72,0:34:02.35,Main,Junsa,0,0,0,,Anomalies in the electrical system \N for several attractions,
Dialogue: 10,0:34:02.35,0:34:04.69,Main,Junsa,0,0,0,,laundry detergent \N covering the streets,{Intentional bleed to help with readability. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:04.69,0:34:07.32,Main,Junsa,0,0,0,,and all kinds of other pranks \N have been reported.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:07.32,0:34:09.32,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Who could have done this?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:17.08,0:34:18.45,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:18.95,0:34:21.54,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Because of you \N I spent the whole night—
Dialogue: 10,0:34:21.54,0:34:24.13,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I know! Just say something random.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:24.13,0:34:27.46,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’m with my niece. \N Help me save face here!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:27.46,0:34:28.17,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:28.17,0:34:29.51,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Huh?{Added line. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:29.51,0:34:30.51,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’m begging you!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:30.51,0:34:31.42,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Huh?!{Added line. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:31.42,0:34:34.22,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,When you die, \N it is {\i1}not{\i0} going to be pretty.{You know what, old man? You’re gonna die alone and so fucking desperate for the sweet escape of death that you’ll be crying tears of blood into your already blood-soaked clothes from the absolute fucking beating you’re going to take at the paws of my OP as shit fucking Eevee.}{Fixed the double for in the commented line. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:34.22,0:34:37.01,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Lady, you got the Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:37.01,0:34:39.93,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Sure did! \N And it’s {\i1}all{\i0} thanks to your uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:42.60,0:34:43.98,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Excuse me, everybody.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:43.98,0:34:47.82,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We will make an announcement \N once the festival is ready to be reopened.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:47.82,0:34:49.65,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Please be patient for just a bit longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:49.65,0:34:51.03,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,That’s all they can do, I guess...{Well, nothing for it...}
Dialogue: 10,0:34:51.03,0:34:53.15,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Should we just pass some time \N back at the hotel?
Dialogue: 10,0:34:53.99,0:34:56.28,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mayor, we’ll help out, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:56.28,0:34:57.49,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Oh, Satoshi!
Dialogue: 10,0:34:57.49,0:34:58.08,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Largo.
Dialogue: 10,0:34:58.08,0:35:01.54,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Oh, you two knew each other already?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:01.54,0:35:03.04,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,We met in town yesterday.
Dialogue: 10,0:35:03.04,0:35:06.92,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hey, when you said “We,” \N you were including me, too, weren’t you?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:06.92,0:35:10.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Well, we all want this fixed \N so we can get back to the Wind Festival, right?{Literally “Because it’s better if it goes back to normal fast so we can do the Wind Festival, right?” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:35:11.46,0:35:13.88,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Let’s help them, too, Uncle!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:13.88,0:35:14.76,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Eh?!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:14.76,0:35:19.93,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I would be happy to receive help from \N the Catching Contest top two!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:22.02,0:35:27.81,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Well, actually, I have business to attend to \N over at the science presentation...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:28.69,0:35:30.86,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,The science presentation? Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:30.86,0:35:32.86,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:32.86,0:35:35.03,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That’s just another one \N of your lies, isn’t it?
Dialogue: 10,0:35:35.03,0:35:36.41,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Poor girl...
Dialogue: 10,0:35:37.11,0:35:40.58,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I won’t tell anyone about that thing earlier, \N so you better help us here!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:42.70,0:35:45.04,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, fine!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:45.04,0:35:47.63,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right! Let’s do this!
Dialogue: 10,0:35:58.47,0:36:00.39,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Now there’s another one...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:00.85,0:36:02.39,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:03.31,0:36:06.85,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Doctor, didn’t you have \N a presentation today?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:06.85,0:36:07.56,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 10,0:36:14.15,0:36:16.61,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,It’s time for the PokéRan Channel!{Oh dear I seem to have turned off Adblock, what a shame. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:36:16.61,0:36:19.37,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,The second day of the Wind Festival \N is off to a turbulent start!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:20.49,0:36:24.33,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Someone’s been playing pranks, \N preventing them from starting up for the day,
Dialogue: 10,0:36:24.33,0:36:29.33,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,but it looks like the festival committee and the citizens \N are hard at work getting everything back in order,
Dialogue: 10,0:36:29.33,0:36:30.96,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,so there’s no need to worry!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:35.55,0:36:38.22,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,Sheesh... \N Why do {\i1}we{\i0} have to help out?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:38.22,0:36:40.47,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,It’s probably just \N Zeraora’s Curse, you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:36:43.31,0:36:44.18,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You guys!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:44.18,0:36:44.89,Main,Two Times Kid,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:44.89,0:36:48.02,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hey, what’s this \N “Zeraora’s Curse” thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:48.39,0:36:50.02,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,You haven’t heard?
Dialogue: 10,0:36:50.02,0:36:54.78,Main,Kid B,0,0,0,,Zeraora, who died in the fire fifty years ago, \N put a curse on the mountain, you know!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:54.78,0:36:58.57,Main,Kid C,0,0,0,,If people set even one foot on the mountain, \N disaster will befall them!
Dialogue: 10,0:36:58.57,0:37:00.82,Main,Kid A,0,0,0,,That’s Zeraora’s Curse!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:00.82,0:37:01.87,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:01.87,0:37:03.78,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,That’s not true!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:03.78,0:37:06.33,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Wh-What’s gotten into you?
Dialogue: 10,0:37:08.79,0:37:11.29,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,This is a message from \N the Wind Festival administration.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:11.29,0:37:13.88,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We have verified that \N everything is secure,
Dialogue: 10,0:37:13.88,0:37:16.71,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,so the Wind Festival is reopened \N as of this moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:17.34,0:37:18.55,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Great to hear!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:19.05,0:37:21.80,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,It really didn’t take that long \N when we all worked together!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:21.80,0:37:22.72,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,We did it!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:23.35,0:37:25.60,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,There’s been an emergency...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:25.97,0:37:28.18,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s hurry and finish up the rest, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:29.02,0:37:32.06,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,What a relief... \N Let’s hurry and get ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:32.06,0:37:33.06,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,0:37:33.06,0:37:36.28,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Doctor, {\i1}another{\i0} one showed up...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:36.28,0:37:41.32,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You’d better hurry and do something, \N before I’m buried in Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:41.32,0:37:43.20,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I-I’m very sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:43.20,0:37:45.12,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’ll find a solution \N before you’re buried.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:45.91,0:37:47.79,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,As soon as \N the presentation is over...
Dialogue: 10,0:37:47.79,0:37:49.04,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I’m counting on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:37:59.38,0:38:01.34,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,The cable cars are \N running again, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:01.34,0:38:02.80,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That’s case closed.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:10.81,0:38:12.69,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Huh? Where’s Uncle?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:16.77,0:38:18.48,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,He’s acting {\i1}really{\i0} suspicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:18.48,0:38:19.99,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Maybe he’s the one \N who pulled the pranks?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:19.99,0:38:21.32,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,He’s not!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:21.32,0:38:22.86,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Well, let’s follow him!
Dialogue: 10,0:38:26.74,0:38:28.04,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,He’s not coming...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:28.04,0:38:30.08,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito, we’re running out of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:30.08,0:38:31.41,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,O-Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:32.04,0:38:34.33,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is the footage for \N the presentation.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:34.33,0:38:35.00,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:35.42,0:38:37.09,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:38:37.09,0:38:38.67,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I-I’ll manage, one way or...
Dialogue: 10,0:38:40.88,0:38:42.22,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,He’s hopeless.
Dialogue: 10,0:38:46.01,0:38:48.18,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Move! Move! Move!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:12.66,0:39:14.21,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:17.84,0:39:20.09,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Um... Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:20.09,0:39:21.26,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:21.26,0:39:25.68,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you all for... for...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:29.39,0:39:31.52,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Man up! You {\i1}are{\i0} a man, aren’t you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:31.52,0:39:37.44,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,...for coming here, um...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:32.43,0:39:34.44,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}What’s wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:34.44,0:39:36.02,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}Stage fright?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:43.28,0:39:45.86,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I’m too late!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:45.86,0:39:47.07,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mr. Kagachi{honorific note: Kagachi-san}!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:47.45,0:39:50.12,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Big brother, \N what do you need here?
Dialogue: 10,0:39:50.12,0:39:51.49,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:51.95,0:39:54.46,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito, the footage!
Dialogue: 10,0:39:56.17,0:39:56.87,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,0:39:57.67,0:39:59.79,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You don’t have any \N new members this time, do you?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:07.84,0:40:10.43,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Mr. Kagachi{honorific note: Kagachi-san}, if you catch that one, \N you’ll be in first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:10.43,0:40:11.64,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Water Gun will work best on it.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:11.64,0:40:14.43,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Gotcha. Use Water Gun!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:15.56,0:40:17.06,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,There!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:19.02,0:40:20.73,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:20.73,0:40:23.53,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Now I won’t have to disappoint Lily.
Dialogue: 10,0:40:23.53,0:40:26.49,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,180)}My niece believes that \N I’m an amazing trainer.{Is the fade synced up to the video being turned off too much? -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:40:27.20,0:40:29.87,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Big brother, what was that?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:30.45,0:40:32.66,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Umm... Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:35.33,0:40:38.00,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Uncle... Isn’t that...?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:38.00,0:40:40.17,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Oh, th-this is...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:41.09,0:40:43.09,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Did you... lie?
Dialogue: 10,0:40:50.09,0:40:52.51,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Who are you people?!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:53.14,0:40:55.64,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,If you ask us “Who are you people?!”...
Dialogue: 10,0:40:55.64,0:40:57.81,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,We’ll answer out of \N sympathy for the world!
Dialogue: 10,0:40:57.81,0:41:00.23,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,No, this is no time to \N be answering, meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:01.90,0:41:03.07,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,That said...
Dialogue: 10,0:41:03.07,0:41:03.73,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,We’re leaving!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:06.32,0:41:08.53,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 10,0:41:08.53,0:41:09.57,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I hate you!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:10.11,0:41:11.12,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Lily, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:14.08,0:41:14.54,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Lily!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:15.41,0:41:16.45,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Lily?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:19.33,0:41:22.50,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Thieves! They’re getting away!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:24.34,0:41:25.42,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Team Rocket?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:25.88,0:41:27.13,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s get ‘em, Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:37.47,0:41:39.98,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee! Eevee!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:44.52,0:41:45.77,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:46.32,0:41:47.69,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What do I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:47.69,0:41:49.36,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:49.36,0:41:50.11,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee!
Dialogue: 10,0:41:50.86,0:41:51.91,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:52.45,0:41:53.57,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Can you help it?
Dialogue: 10,0:41:53.57,0:41:55.58,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I can. There’s no need to worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:41:55.58,0:41:57.37,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Lucky, use Healing Pulse. {Marking move name. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:41:58.95,0:41:59.79,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:00.33,0:42:02.50,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Eevee...
Dialogue: 10,0:42:04.21,0:42:05.88,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Hold it, Team Rocket!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:05.88,0:42:07.09,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Stinking brat boy!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:07.09,0:42:08.34,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Give it up already!{More hypocritical words have never been spoken... Or, I mean, this is an AU story so for all I know this might just be only the second time they’re meeting in this continuity. It can’t be the first, since they clearly know each other. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:42:09.26,0:42:11.51,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, use 100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:13.26,0:42:15.01,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Do your thing, Sohnansu!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:30.36,0:42:31.49,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee!
Dialogue: 10,0:42:32.91,0:42:34.57,Main,Joy,0,0,0,,It’s fine now.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:34.57,0:42:36.37,Main,Joy,0,0,0,,Good thing we were able \N to treat it quickly.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:37.03,0:42:43.04,Main,Joy,0,0,0,,Its leg is still slightly hurt, \N but it will be fine if you let it rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:44.29,0:42:45.83,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:53.47,0:42:55.01,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,How is Lily{honorific note: Lily-chan}?
Dialogue: 10,0:42:55.84,0:42:57.89,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,They just had a doctor \N take a look at her.
Dialogue: 10,0:42:58.43,0:43:01.52,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Her body’s always been weak...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:02.06,0:43:04.85,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Looks like the fatigue from \N the past few days caught up with her.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:04.85,0:43:07.11,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m sorry. It’s my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:07.11,0:43:10.32,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Nah, it’s my fault for \N lying all the time.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:16.28,0:43:17.49,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:18.37,0:43:21.04,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’m sorry. I lost them.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:22.33,0:43:23.25,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Eevee’s injured?!
Dialogue: 10,0:43:23.25,0:43:27.00,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Yeah... After you left, \N I lost it in the crowd...
Dialogue: 10,0:43:27.00,0:43:29.21,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,But I just had Ms. Joy{honorific note: Joy-san} take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:29.21,0:43:30.84,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,It’s all right.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:30.84,0:43:31.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:32.38,0:43:33.92,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That lousy Team Rocket! {Changed to “Team Rocket”. Kinda wanna suggest a synonym for lousy, but no real ideas (“blasted” is probably too on the nose). Leave it you be if you think it’s good as it is. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:43:33.92,0:43:37.18,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,What they took was a chemical \N made from Spores{ほうし}.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:37.18,0:43:38.39,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Does Ms. Junsa{honorific note: Junsa-san} know?
Dialogue: 10,0:43:38.39,0:43:40.22,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Yes, I told her.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:40.22,0:43:42.35,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,It looks like they’ll continue searching.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:44.60,0:43:47.10,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Everybody must be tired.
Dialogue: 10,0:43:47.10,0:43:49.23,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Let’s go home and rest.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:02.95,0:44:04.20,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,How’s Lily?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:04.20,0:44:05.46,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,She’s asleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:06.16,0:44:09.50,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,I’m planning on \N taking her home tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:09.50,0:44:10.67,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:11.63,0:44:13.38,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 10,0:44:13.84,0:44:15.42,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:15.42,0:44:17.93,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,...don’t deserve to show my face \N around Lily anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:18.76,0:44:20.68,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I betrayed her.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:26.35,0:44:27.98,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,You’re such a fool...
Dialogue: 10,0:44:36.74,0:44:39.03,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Don’t follow me... \N Just leave me alone!
Dialogue: 10,0:44:39.95,0:44:43.24,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,It’s not like you’re \N my Pokémon or anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:43.87,0:44:48.08,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You’re throwing what I told you \N right back in my face... and I deserve it.
Dialogue: 10,0:44:48.08,0:44:52.50,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’m done lying. \N There’s no point in you following me. {Suggesting “done” in place of “quitting”. If line 1042 should match, then suggesting “being done” in place of “quitting” for that line. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:44:53.21,0:44:55.09,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Go wherever you want.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:03.43,0:45:06.73,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you \N to stop following me?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:07.27,0:45:10.65,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I’m done with that stuff. \N Never again...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:11.27,0:45:13.69,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I’d rather be on my own than...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:19.53,0:45:21.45,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,If only I’d have run back then...
Dialogue: 10,0:45:23.28,0:45:24.95,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Could I have protected you?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:26.66,0:45:28.91,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I see. Well done.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:29.54,0:45:31.25,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 10,0:45:31.25,0:45:32.17,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Largo.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:32.17,0:45:33.63,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,What’ll happen to \N the Wind Festival tomorrow?{Bleh. DESPERATELY needs shortening. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:45:34.00,0:45:37.05,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We just agreed that it’ll proceed.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:37.05,0:45:40.51,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We should be able to meet safety requirements \N by strengthening security.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:40.51,0:45:42.30,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Oh. That’s good!
Dialogue: 10,0:45:42.72,0:45:44.72,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Don’t worry, just sleep.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:44.72,0:45:46.77,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We’ll have to \N summon Lugia tomorrow.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:46.77,0:45:48.85,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Sure. Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:45:48.85,0:45:49.64,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:42.11,0:46:43.74,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}Cheers!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,0:46:46.03,0:46:48.08,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Now, bring it out!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:48.08,0:46:50.95,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Wait... You mean \N you weren’t holding it?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:50.95,0:46:53.17,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Huh? I mean, I handed it off \N to Nyarth, didn’t I?
Dialogue: 10,0:46:53.17,0:46:55.46,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Wha? I didn’t get it, meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:55.46,0:46:56.84,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Sure I handed it to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:46:56.84,0:46:59.50,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,I said “Nyarth!” and \N passed it behind me.
Dialogue: 10,0:46:59.50,0:47:02.55,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,I was running in front of you \N the whole time, meow!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:02.55,0:47:04.93,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Then, that means...
Dialogue: 10,0:47:05.51,0:47:08.10,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Huh? Then who did I pass it to?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:08.10,0:47:09.77,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Freaky!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:09.77,0:47:12.68,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,Oh, no way! Is it, like, \N a Ghost-type kinda situation?!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:33.08,0:47:35.00,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:35.46,0:47:37.00,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen this before!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:49.10,0:47:50.14,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Risa?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:50.14,0:47:53.18,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hey... There’s a lot of noise outside.
Dialogue: 10,0:47:54.35,0:47:55.89,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:47:57.19,0:47:58.48,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Satoshi, look!
Dialogue: 10,0:47:59.15,0:48:00.52,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,The windmills are...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:00.52,0:48:01.86,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,I heard the wind’s weakened...
Dialogue: 10,0:48:02.32,0:48:04.32,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,...because the Sacred Flame disappeared.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:04.32,0:48:06.53,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Disappeared? The whole thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:06.53,0:48:07.28,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:07.28,0:48:10.37,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Then... We’ve got bigger problems \N than the Wind Festival, no?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:13.08,0:48:14.62,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,The Sacred Flame?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:15.50,0:48:16.29,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s go!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:18.38,0:48:21.67,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Sheesh... \N Why do we have to do this?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:21.67,0:48:24.26,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Whose fault do they think it is \N that the presentation failed?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:24.26,0:48:25.80,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,We hear you.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:25.80,0:48:30.30,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,We never should have had him \N work on the presentation in the first place.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:30.30,0:48:32.64,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,You should’ve said that \N before we started!
Dialogue: 10,0:48:33.27,0:48:35.35,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:36.85,0:48:41.19,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito cares more about Pokémon \N than anybody else here.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:41.77,0:48:44.28,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Is there anybody else here who \N loves Pokémon as much as him?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:44.28,0:48:46.15,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Who knows as much \N about Pokémon as him?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:46.15,0:48:47.90,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Anyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:48:48.53,0:48:53.87,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,I believe that he has what’s most important \N for a Pokémon researcher to have.{Oh god this whole thing is SO clichéd it’s almost unbearable. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:48:54.41,0:48:56.29,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,More so than any of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:48:59.50,0:49:01.21,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,The wind’s stopped...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:01.21,0:49:03.09,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,What’s going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:07.51,0:49:09.97,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Lily, are you doing all right?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:11.64,0:49:12.80,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Where’s Uncle?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:13.97,0:49:15.64,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,He said he was going home \N ahead of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:16.47,0:49:17.73,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:18.31,0:49:20.90,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,...was so mean to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:20.90,0:49:22.19,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Lily.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:22.19,0:49:25.07,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,“It’ll be fine! Cheer up!”
Dialogue: 10,0:49:25.07,0:49:27.07,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,“It didn’t bother Uncle one bit!”
Dialogue: 10,0:49:31.87,0:49:33.58,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 10,0:49:33.99,0:49:34.95,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Satoshi{honorific note: Satoshi-kun}.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:34.95,0:49:36.54,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Is it true that \N the Sacred Flame’s gone?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:36.54,0:49:37.04,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,It is.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:37.04,0:49:38.41,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,And that’s why the wind’s...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:38.79,0:49:41.75,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Lugia uses the Flame as a marker \N to send the wind to us.{Copied verbatim from Largo’s line at 11:05, line 198 -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:49:41.75,0:49:42.92,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,But now...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:43.34,0:49:47.05,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Lugia doesn’t know where \N to send the wind?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:47.05,0:49:47.71,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:47.71,0:49:52.84,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,If the Sacred Flame isn’t found by the end of the final day, \N which is to say, by sunrise tomorrow...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:52.84,0:49:55.68,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,The city’s power reserves \N will eventually run dry.
Dialogue: 10,0:49:55.68,0:49:57.39,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:49:57.39,0:49:59.18,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Can I take a closer look?
Dialogue: 10,0:49:59.18,0:50:00.14,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:03.48,0:50:07.23,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,You know, I’m really \N not good with heights!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:14.37,0:50:15.78,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What’s up, Pikachu?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:16.41,0:50:17.66,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You’ve figured something out, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:17.66,0:50:19.79,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,We’re going back down?!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:22.46,0:50:24.13,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Good! This one’s real feisty!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:24.13,0:50:26.50,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,All of these Pokémon oughta \N fetch a high price!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:26.50,0:50:29.42,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Pokémon living in good health, \N out in the untouched nature...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:30.13,0:50:31.84,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Talk about a rewarding hunt!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:38.89,0:50:40.77,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,U-Umm... Pikachu?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:40.77,0:50:42.10,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu!
Dialogue: 10,0:50:42.10,0:50:44.06,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,You mean the one that \N stole the Sacred Flame...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:44.06,0:50:45.65,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,...was Doble?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:47.07,0:50:48.15,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,The Sacred Flame?
Dialogue: 10,0:50:48.15,0:50:49.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s been stolen.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:49.99,0:50:52.86,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu followed the scent \N from the pedestal to here...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:52.86,0:50:54.57,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,And found Doble.
Dialogue: 10,0:50:54.57,0:50:56.24,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Doble’s scent...
Dialogue: 10,0:50:57.78,0:50:59.29,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Could it be Doble’s ink?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:01.75,0:51:02.79,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Perhaps...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:04.92,0:51:07.59,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I thought it just slipped and \N fell down back then...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:07.59,0:51:09.21,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Could someone have \N knocked it down?
Dialogue: 10,0:51:09.96,0:51:13.93,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I can’t be sure, but if it was...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:16.18,0:51:19.39,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Doble uses ink to mark its territory.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:19.76,0:51:25.27,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I wanted to use it for marking, \N but distilling it made it turn transparent.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:25.27,0:51:27.90,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,But I can use this flashlight to...
Dialogue: 10,0:51:30.90,0:51:32.15,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Bingo.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:32.15,0:51:33.40,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:33.40,0:51:35.16,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, it’s all thanks to you!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:36.03,0:51:39.08,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,If we follow these tracks, \N they should lead us to the thief.
Dialogue: 10,0:51:39.58,0:51:40.58,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s get going!
Dialogue: 10,0:51:51.25,0:51:53.01,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I hope they’ve canceled it now...{Check on canceled VS cancelled. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:51:54.67,0:51:57.89,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. This time, I’ll protect you.{I would just like to point out that this movie took nearly 52 minutes to even SHOW its featured mythical Pokémon... Which I think is a good thing. BUILDUP in a POKÉMON MOVIE?! What is this madness?! -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:52:04.60,0:52:07.52,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Didn’t think there’d be \N a place like this in Fura City.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:08.10,0:52:10.73,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Let’s start looking for \N rare Pokémon already!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:10.73,0:52:13.65,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,People will come here in droves \N after seeing that broadcast!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:13.65,0:52:14.28,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:14.69,0:52:16.91,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Those people are here for Zeraora?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:19.57,0:52:20.53,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:20.53,0:52:22.95,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,What brings you guys here?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:22.95,0:52:25.66,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,You from Fura City, little girl?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:25.66,0:52:28.63,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,You haven’t seen any rare Pokémon \N around here, have you?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:28.63,0:52:29.54,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I sure have!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:29.54,0:52:30.59,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:30.59,0:52:31.25,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Where?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:32.21,0:52:33.38,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,That way!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:33.38,0:52:35.01,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,It’s like nothing I’ve ever seen!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:35.01,0:52:37.01,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Thank you, little girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:37.01,0:52:39.05,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Oh, you’re quite welcome!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:43.81,0:52:44.89,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,What’s that?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:44.89,0:52:46.60,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,A Himeguma and a Metamon, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:46.60,0:52:48.02,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:50.94,0:52:53.82,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Y-You’d better hurry, \N or the rare Pokémon will get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:53.82,0:52:54.69,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Do you want that?
Dialogue: 10,0:52:54.69,0:52:56.57,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,We’ll be taking those, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:52:56.57,0:52:57.61,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,{\an8}Come out, Hellgar!
Dialogue: 10,0:52:56.57,0:52:57.61,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Let’s go, Nyula!{Oh balls. Two lines of equal importance said at exactly the same time. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:03.28,0:53:04.83,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Hellgar! Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:04.83,0:53:06.91,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Nyula! Icy Wind! {Marking move name. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:16.46,0:53:18.55,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,No, Zeraora! You have to hide!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:18.55,0:53:20.97,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! \N I’ve never seen this one before!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:20.97,0:53:22.26,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,{\i1}There’s{\i0} the rare Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:22.26,0:53:23.30,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Fire Fang! {Marking move name. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:23.30,0:53:24.18,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Slash! {Marking move name. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:36.11,0:53:38.19,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora! You mustn’t push yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:38.19,0:53:39.95,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,You’re still injured!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:40.61,0:53:41.57,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,It’s really fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:41.57,0:53:43.70,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,But it looks like it’s hurt.
Dialogue: 10,0:53:43.70,0:53:46.08,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Yeah. Don’t let this chance get away!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:46.08,0:53:47.12,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Ice Shard! {Marking move name. - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,0:53:52.88,0:53:54.25,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Keep putting pressure on it!
Dialogue: 10,0:53:54.25,0:53:56.09,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Hellgar, use Flamethrower!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:07.47,0:54:08.89,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:08.89,0:54:10.89,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:10.89,0:54:12.81,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora, they’ll catch you!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:12.81,0:54:15.02,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Now, let’s finish this.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:24.03,0:54:24.91,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:27.83,0:54:29.83,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Largo?
Dialogue: 10,0:54:30.75,0:54:32.54,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You did good by yourself!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:32.96,0:54:34.08,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Satoshi...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:35.50,0:54:37.67,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Father... Everybody...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:38.25,0:54:40.55,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I am the mayor of Fura City.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:40.55,0:54:44.47,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Choose your next move wisely, \N or I’ll take legal action! {Oh no! Anything but due process! -T}
Dialogue: 10,0:54:44.47,0:54:45.55,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,This ain’t good...
Dialogue: 10,0:54:45.55,0:54:46.43,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,We’d better leave.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:46.43,0:54:47.31,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:48.93,0:54:50.27,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:54:50.27,0:54:53.60,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Don’t go after them. \N We have other things to worry about.
Dialogue: 10,0:54:57.19,0:55:00.24,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Father, it’s not Zeraora’s fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:00.24,0:55:02.32,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I was the one who did it.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:02.90,0:55:04.70,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,That’s Zeraora?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:04.70,0:55:05.66,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,That’s right.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:05.66,0:55:07.37,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,But the stories say it died.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:07.37,0:55:09.83,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,And yet, it’s lying right in front of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:13.16,0:55:14.87,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is it, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:16.92,0:55:21.17,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Do you understand how \N much trouble you’ve caused?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:22.51,0:55:23.59,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Largo?
Dialogue: 10,0:55:25.55,0:55:28.89,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I first met Zeraora a little while back...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:29.72,0:55:32.85,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I was playing with the Pokémon \N at the foot of the mountain.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:32.85,0:55:34.94,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But then a rock fell...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:37.56,0:55:40.98,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,It could have crushed us all, easily...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:40.98,0:55:45.15,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But Zeraora protected \N me and the Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:46.28,0:55:49.28,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But it got hurt in the process...
Dialogue: 10,0:55:50.41,0:55:51.79,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,It was my fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:52.37,0:55:55.21,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,So I thought I had to look after it.
Dialogue: 10,0:55:56.67,0:55:59.63,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Everyone in the city \N is scared of Zeraora...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:00.25,0:56:05.68,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I thought that I, alone, had to be on its side, \N and look after it until its wounds healed.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:05.68,0:56:09.39,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But there was that man who knew \N there was a rare Pokémon here...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:12.89,0:56:16.27,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I knew that it was only a matter of time \N before everyone came to try and capture Zeraora.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:16.94,0:56:20.77,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,So I thought they might leave \N if the Wind Festival was canceled...{Check on canceled VS cancelled. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:56:21.69,0:56:25.65,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I knew there’d be trouble \N if I took the Sacred Flame...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:25.65,0:56:27.57,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But once the festival was canceled,{Check on canceled VS cancelled. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,0:56:27.57,0:56:29.32,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I was going to put it back! I swear!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:33.33,0:56:36.54,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I’m sorry! I’m so sorry!
Dialogue: 10,0:56:37.42,0:56:38.96,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Largo...
Dialogue: 10,0:56:43.84,0:56:44.84,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Largo.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:44.84,0:56:47.43,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,You did well protecting Zeraora.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:47.43,0:56:47.97,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,{LARGO NOISE timed mostly because I didn’t want Oliver’s subtitle to go over it.}
Dialogue: 10,0:56:48.80,0:56:51.18,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,There’s something I must tell you.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:52.22,0:56:54.18,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,The truth about Zeraora.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:55.77,0:56:59.35,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Zeraora has been living here \N for a very long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:56:59.35,0:57:03.07,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,It was the lord of this land, \N and had the respect of the Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:03.07,0:57:04.94,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,They lived together in peace.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:06.03,0:57:07.99,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,As for us humans...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:07.99,0:57:13.20,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We cut down the forest where those Pokémon lived, \N seeking a rich life for ourselves.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:14.08,0:57:17.04,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,But that was what caused...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:17.04,0:57:19.04,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,...the wildfire fifty years ago.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:21.25,0:57:22.79,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:22.79,0:57:25.00,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,The forest turned into a sea of fire...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:25.00,0:57:29.30,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,The people didn’t have time to \N concern themselves with the wild Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:31.09,0:57:33.05,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,They were all panicking.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:33.05,0:57:38.18,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,But Zeraora refused to abandon \N the Pokémon that had been left behind.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:38.77,0:57:43.82,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Zeraora has held a deep grudge \N against humans ever since.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:44.19,0:57:45.69,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,That’s why it was so...
Dialogue: 10,0:57:45.69,0:57:49.99,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,But the people continued to \N lose Zeraora’s trust.
Dialogue: 10,0:57:50.82,0:57:54.41,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,All Zeraora wanted was to \N live in the forest with the Pokémon,
Dialogue: 10,0:57:54.41,0:57:58.45,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,but trainers came in droves, \N hoping to catch it.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:03.08,0:58:05.84,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,The mayor at the time \N wanted to make amends,
Dialogue: 10,0:58:05.84,0:58:08.84,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,so he decided to lie to the city.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:08.84,0:58:14.68,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,“Zeraora is dead. It has cursed the mountain, so setting foot on it is strictly forbidden.”
Dialogue: 10,0:58:15.22,0:58:19.98,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,That was the only thing \N we could do to protect Zeraora.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:20.35,0:58:22.02,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I never knew...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:22.02,0:58:25.82,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,There aren’t many who \N know the truth.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:26.40,0:58:28.11,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Especially not the younger people.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:28.65,0:58:32.24,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,This is the truth about Zeraora.
Dialogue: 10,0:58:42.54,0:58:43.58,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:46.59,0:58:47.63,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Smoke?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:48.05,0:58:50.09,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Some sort of Wind Festival event?
Dialogue: 10,0:58:50.09,0:58:51.26,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 10,0:58:56.10,0:58:57.60,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Hey, that looks pretty bad, \N doesn’t it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:57.60,0:58:59.10,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,It’s headed this way!
Dialogue: 10,0:58:59.93,0:59:01.31,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,What is that?!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:03.69,0:59:05.81,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, no... It can’t be...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:05.81,0:59:08.15,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Do you know something?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:14.57,0:59:15.57,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Ah, wait!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:17.45,0:59:19.79,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,The color of that smoke... \N These symptoms...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:20.41,0:59:22.37,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This may be \N the Spores{ほうし} chemical.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:22.37,0:59:24.17,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,The one that Team Rocket stole?!
Dialogue: 10,0:59:24.67,0:59:25.58,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:25.58,0:59:27.84,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Lucky, please use Aromatherapy.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:29.84,0:59:32.67,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,What do you mean, \N “Spores{ほうし} chemical”?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:32.67,0:59:34.76,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,It was still in the testing stage...
Dialogue: 10,0:59:35.30,0:59:39.56,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,The capsule contained a highly concentrated chemical \N with the properties of the Pokémon ability Spores{ほうし}.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:39.56,0:59:41.68,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,And that’s related to these Pokémon?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:42.98,0:59:47.56,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,If you inhale the Spores{ほうし}, \N you’ll suffer poison and paralysis.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:47.56,0:59:49.11,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s what that smoke does?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:49.11,0:59:50.27,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Why would you even {\i1}make{\i0} that?
Dialogue: 10,0:59:50.86,0:59:55.28,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,While researching, I found that \N it can be used to treat human illnesses.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:57.99,0:59:58.70,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,It’s me.
Dialogue: 10,0:59:58.70,1:00:00.95,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,Mayor, reporting in...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:00.95,1:00:05.12,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,A smoke of unknown origin has sprung forth, \N and a fourth of Fura City has been covered in it.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:05.12,1:00:07.00,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,It’s continuing to spread as we speak.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:07.00,1:00:11.71,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,We’ve confirmed that it’s a toxic substance \N that paralyzes anyone who inhales it.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:11.71,1:00:16.26,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,We’ve issued an emergency evacuation order \N for those in the affected areas.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:16.26,1:00:19.26,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,There is no time to waste. \N Please, come back at once!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:19.26,1:00:20.18,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 10,1:00:21.51,1:00:22.89,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Father...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:25.60,1:00:26.64,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is my fault...
Dialogue: 10,1:00:36.78,1:00:39.66,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s do this! Just watching \N won’t do anyone any good!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:40.41,1:00:43.20,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s protect Fura City, together!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:43.20,1:00:44.45,Main,Everyone,0,0,0,,{\i1}What?{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:00:44.45,1:00:46.58,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Well, what are we supposed \N to do against that?
Dialogue: 10,1:00:46.58,1:00:50.17,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We’ve got Pokémon! \N You’re with me, yeah?{The second half is worded like a question and he looks RIGHT AT Poi while saying it, so... -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:00:51.59,1:00:52.92,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We can’t do everything on our own,
Dialogue: 10,1:00:52.92,1:00:54.71,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,but with Pokémon, \N we can do anything!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:55.42,1:00:59.68,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Courage and strength just spring out \N when we’re with our Pokémon!
Dialogue: 10,1:00:59.68,1:01:02.26,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s Pokémon Power!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:06.64,1:01:09.19,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Pokémon Power? That’s so cheesy!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:12.19,1:01:13.61,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Pokémon Power, is it?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:16.28,1:01:18.78,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I suppose you’re right. \N Let’s give it a try!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:18.78,1:01:20.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Now you’re talking!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:20.03,1:01:22.83,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Doctor, is there any way \N to get rid of that smoke?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:22.83,1:01:23.33,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Eh?!{Added Torito noise because I didn’t want Oliver’s line to cover this. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:01:24.08,1:01:26.70,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Umm, if I go back to my laboratory...
Dialogue: 10,1:01:26.70,1:01:30.92,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,...and mass-produce a chemical based off \N the Pokémon ability Natural Recovery...
Dialogue: 10,1:01:30.92,1:01:35.38,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, it won’t work! I can’t spread that \N throughout the entire city!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:35.38,1:01:37.51,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,What if we use the wind?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:37.51,1:01:38.30,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,The wind?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:38.67,1:01:40.13,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,We have the old power plant.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:40.13,1:01:41.59,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:41.59,1:01:43.39,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But isn’t it broken down?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:43.76,1:01:46.18,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,No, Ms. Hisui{honorific note: Hisui-san} can make it work!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:46.18,1:01:47.43,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 10,1:01:50.77,1:01:53.27,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I made that power plant. {I was the one who made it.}
Dialogue: 10,1:01:53.27,1:01:56.40,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Wow! I never would have guessed!
Dialogue: 10,1:01:56.40,1:01:59.90,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,The propellers can be faced \N in different directions.
Dialogue: 10,1:01:59.90,1:02:04.08,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,If we spin them in reverse, \N we should be able to make the wind blow.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:04.08,1:02:08.33,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,But there’s probably only \N a fifty-fifty chance that it will run.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:08.33,1:02:09.58,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Fifty-fifty?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:09.58,1:02:11.25,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Okay! Let’s do it!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:12.33,1:02:14.34,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You all help, too, will you?
Dialogue: 10,1:02:14.34,1:02:16.38,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,This’ll require some physical labor.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:17.17,1:02:20.80,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Well then, Doctor, Ms. Hisui{honorific note: Hisui-san}, \N you head for the old power plant.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:20.80,1:02:22.51,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll go with Risa and Largo...
Dialogue: 10,1:02:22.51,1:02:26.81,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,...to give aid to Zeraora and the Pokémon in the forest, \N and bring them somewhere safe!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:26.81,1:02:27.31,Main,Largo & Risa,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:27.31,1:02:31.52,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,The smoke is denser than air, \N so the mountaintops should be the safest place.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:32.10,1:02:33.94,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,And take this. A Potion.{NOTE: He says キズぐすり, “kizugusuri”, which is the regular basic Potion item, despite the fact that what’s in his hand is a Super Potion, いいキズぐすり, “ii kizugusuri”. Probably because that literally translates to “Good wound medicine” which sounds ABSOLUTELY RIDICULOUS in a sentence? -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:02:34.48,1:02:36.86,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Please use it on the Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:36.86,1:02:38.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:38.44,1:02:41.53,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Well then, good luck, everyone!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:43.91,1:02:44.74,Main,Junsa,0,0,0,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:45.16,1:02:47.12,Main,Junsa,0,0,0,,Please, evacuate in an orderly fashion!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:50.54,1:02:53.58,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Mia! Where are you? \N Is Lily okay?!
Dialogue: 10,1:02:54.00,1:02:56.09,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Yes, we’re fine.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:56.50,1:02:58.38,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,We’re riding the aerial lift right now.
Dialogue: 10,1:02:58.88,1:03:02.72,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,But it seems like it’s made an emergency stop. \N It’s not moving.
Dialogue: 10,1:03:03.59,1:03:05.97,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,Uncle, hel—
Dialogue: 10,1:03:07.05,1:03:08.51,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Hey, Lily! Mia!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:13.23,1:03:14.65,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Can I even help them?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:18.61,1:03:19.48,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:23.53,1:03:25.07,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’m completely worthless...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:33.33,1:03:35.37,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Didn’t I tell you {not to follow me?}to leave me alone?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:37.13,1:03:38.00,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,What’s your problem?!
Dialogue: 10,1:03:40.50,1:03:42.21,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,What do you think we could do?
Dialogue: 10,1:03:43.01,1:03:46.59,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,We’d just get there, \N make up some lie and run away...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:47.05,1:03:49.31,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You and me, a pair of weaklings...
Dialogue: 10,1:03:54.56,1:03:56.94,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Ow! Hey, what’s your deal?! \N Knock it off!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:01.44,1:04:02.57,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:10.45,1:04:11.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Usokki...
Dialogue: 10,1:04:15.87,1:04:18.83,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You’ll... help me?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:28.18,1:04:30.35,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Thank you, Usokki.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:34.39,1:04:36.77,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I take back what I said \N about being done lying.
Dialogue: 10,1:04:36.77,1:04:38.27,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’ll lie as much as it takes,
Dialogue: 10,1:04:38.94,1:04:41.02,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,if that means I can \N protect what’s dear to me!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:43.23,1:04:45.32,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,We’re unbeatable! {Pokémon! Advanced Battle! - Toa}
Dialogue: 10,1:04:45.32,1:04:48.70,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Together, we’ll save Lily and Mia!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:50.91,1:04:52.12,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:52.12,1:04:54.66,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Wh-Why didn’t you tell me sooner?!
Dialogue: 10,1:04:55.70,1:04:56.66,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Status?
Dialogue: 10,1:04:56.66,1:05:01.00,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,Sir. More than half the city is \N already covered in smoke. {I’m 50/50 on whether this line should extend past the keyframe or not. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:05:01.00,1:05:05.34,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,We’ve asked the Pokémon Center to provide shelter, \N but there’s just not enough room for everybody.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:05.71,1:05:07.84,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,Mayor, how will we fight this?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:08.72,1:05:10.55,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,With Pokémon Power.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:16.48,1:05:17.02,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:17.02,1:05:20.02,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Where did you go? We’ve been given orders \N to use this place as a shelter, too.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:20.40,1:05:21.94,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Um... Well...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:22.44,1:05:24.78,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Help us move these \N research materials, will you?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:26.19,1:05:29.20,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,What’s wrong? \N Torito, are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 10,1:05:29.20,1:05:30.99,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, you see...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:36.29,1:05:40.21,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Pokémon Power... Pokémon Power... \N Pokémon Power...
Dialogue: 10,1:05:40.21,1:05:42.00,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Hurry up, Torito! There’s no time to—
Dialogue: 10,1:05:42.00,1:05:43.38,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Just listen to me!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:44.30,1:05:46.51,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I know that you all hate me.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:47.01,1:05:49.84,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m always fidgeting, \N and I can barely even talk to people.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:49.84,1:05:52.85,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m sure you all think \N I’m a huge weirdo.
Dialogue: 10,1:05:52.85,1:05:55.47,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,But just for now, \N please lend me a hand!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:55.47,1:05:57.68,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,There’s still a way to save the city!
Dialogue: 10,1:05:57.68,1:06:01.94,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I don’t want to run... I want to save \N the people and Pokémon with my research!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:08.24,1:06:08.82,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:08.82,1:06:09.61,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,What?! {His courage literally only lasted for as long as he kept talking uninterrupted ^^; -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:06:09.61,1:06:11.95,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,You always do this.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:11.95,1:06:14.49,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Putting other people and Pokémon’s \N needs before your own...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:15.24,1:06:16.87,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,This time is no different.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:16.87,1:06:18.62,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,I deeply respect you as a scientist.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:18.62,1:06:19.29,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:19.29,1:06:22.42,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,What do you need me to do? \N I want to help.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:22.42,1:06:24.04,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Me, too! Let’s do this!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:24.04,1:06:25.17,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Give us your orders!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:25.17,1:06:26.34,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,What should we do?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:27.42,1:06:28.67,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 10,1:06:34.35,1:06:37.51,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I want to mass-produce \N a Natural Recovery chemical!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:37.51,1:06:40.43,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,All right, everyone, \N let’s get to work!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:41.06,1:06:43.98,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,There it is! We got it now!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:43.98,1:06:45.61,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Where is it hiding?
Dialogue: 10,1:06:45.61,1:06:47.40,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Come out, Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:48.69,1:06:51.49,Main,Hunter,0,0,0,,Don’t let it get away! Catch it!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:53.32,1:06:54.78,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,That should do it.
Dialogue: 10,1:06:55.45,1:06:57.41,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Oh, you’re awake, Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:06:57.41,1:07:00.41,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Don’t worry. Those people are gone.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:00.41,1:07:01.83,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Wait, Largo!{There is also a Largo Noise here that I would rather NOT cover with this subtitle but the keyframe comes in so dang soon afterwards that a subtitle for the Noise would fall below my bare minimum subtitle screen time of 500ms. So... Covered by this subtitle it is, I guess.-TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:07:07.80,1:07:11.09,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It’s all right, Zeraora! \N We haven’t done anything!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:19.72,1:07:22.06,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,I brought it. Where’s the doctor?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:22.06,1:07:23.10,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,He’s not here yet.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:23.98,1:07:27.11,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Hey! How do we clear out that smoke?!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:27.90,1:07:28.94,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Oh, it’s you!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:28.94,1:07:29.69,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Granny?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:29.69,1:07:32.74,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We intend to counteract the poison \N using the old power plant.{Heavily condensed to try and make the CPS not unreasonable. Literal: “Right now the plan is to get the old power plant running, and neutralize the poison (implied: with said power plant.)” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:07:33.32,1:07:35.57,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Lily’s in trouble! So let’s get moving!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:35.57,1:07:37.28,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,To that old plant or whatever...
Dialogue: 10,1:07:38.78,1:07:40.12,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 10,1:07:43.50,1:07:45.17,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,That came from the transformer.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:45.17,1:07:48.04,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,The smoke may have \N caused it to short circuit.
Dialogue: 10,1:07:51.76,1:07:52.63,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Granny!
Dialogue: 10,1:07:54.88,1:07:56.05,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,The power’s going out...
Dialogue: 10,1:07:59.72,1:08:01.64,Main,Nyarth,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry, meow!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:01.64,1:08:04.94,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why does this always happen?!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:08:06.19,1:08:07.65,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Get in here! Quick!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:13.11,1:08:14.28,Main,Musashi,0,0,0,,We made it...
Dialogue: 10,1:08:14.28,1:08:16.53,Main,Kojiro,0,0,0,,Are we safe?
Dialogue: 10,1:08:18.62,1:08:19.37,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,It’s a blackout!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:19.37,1:08:22.45,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Wait, you can’t! Not now!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:22.45,1:08:24.58,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,We were so close!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:29.63,1:08:31.59,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Lucky?
Dialogue: 10,1:08:35.67,1:08:37.51,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Granny, are you okay?!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:38.01,1:08:39.72,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Prepare a bed for her!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:39.72,1:08:40.43,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:40.43,1:08:42.72,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Don’t! I’ll manage.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:43.31,1:08:46.06,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,We can’t wait for the doctor. \N Let’s just go.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:46.48,1:08:48.85,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,It’ll take a while to get \N the old girl running.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:48.85,1:08:51.77,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Right, got it! I’ll take you there!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:56.57,1:08:58.11,Main,Joy,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here you go.
Dialogue: 10,1:08:58.11,1:08:59.24,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,{\an8}Thank you...
Dialogue: 10,1:08:51.77,1:08:53.98,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,First this smoke came \N out of nowhere,
Dialogue: 10,1:08:53.98,1:08:58.32,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,and now there’s been an explosion \N at the transformer, causing a wildfire!
Dialogue: 10,1:08:58.32,1:09:02.62,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,Now it seems that Fura City’s lost its power \N and is covered in darkness!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:02.62,1:09:05.83,Main,PokéRan,0,0,0,,To everyone in Fura City, \N take care of yourselves!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:13.17,1:09:13.84,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:21.01,1:09:22.22,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t tell me it’s...
Dialogue: 10,1:09:22.60,1:09:25.14,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora must have gone \N to help the other Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:28.56,1:09:29.56,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:29.56,1:09:30.19,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Risa!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:30.19,1:09:32.06,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’ll follow Largo.{Gah, once again a Noise that does not come from Satoshi yet any subtitle for it would be too quick to be warranted. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:09:32.44,1:09:35.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You put that thing back {where it came from, or so help me! - Mike} in place \N and summon Lugia!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:35.53,1:09:37.69,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,What?! Hey, wait a second!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:37.69,1:09:41.78,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You can get it there faster \N than anyone else here.
Dialogue: 10,1:09:41.78,1:09:44.03,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,No, you’re the {\i1}only{\i0} one who can!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:45.70,1:09:48.04,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I know you can do it! \N It’s all on you!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:49.12,1:09:50.00,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,There’s no way!
Dialogue: 10,1:09:50.37,1:09:51.50,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 10,1:09:51.50,1:09:52.50,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 10,1:09:53.34,1:09:54.71,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,...can’t run...
Dialogue: 10,1:10:00.05,1:10:01.01,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Eevee?!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:16.07,1:10:18.03,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Why are you trying so hard?!
Dialogue: 10,1:10:33.63,1:10:34.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I mean...{31:49.78 / 1:10:33.61}
Dialogue: 10,1:10:35.17,1:10:37.88,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I kinda feel like, even if there are things \N we can’t do on our own,{32:50.99 / 1:10:35.15}
Dialogue: 10,1:10:37.88,1:10:40.30,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,anything’s possible if we’ve \N got Pokémon with us.{32:53.66 / 1:10:37.86}
Dialogue: 10,1:10:45.10,1:10:46.22,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Together...
Dialogue: 10,1:10:51.02,1:10:54.94,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,We can do anything if we’ve got \N Pokémon with us...?
Dialogue: 10,1:10:56.02,1:10:58.28,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,You’re giving it your all.
Dialogue: 10,1:10:58.98,1:11:00.49,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,So who am I to just give up?{Admittedly very loose take. Literally “I can’t let myself be beaten (by you, in the field of hard-working-ness), can I?” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:11:04.99,1:11:06.95,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Now it’s my turn.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:09.58,1:11:11.96,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Let’s put the Sacred Flame back, \N together!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:12.87,1:11:14.71,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,All right...
Dialogue: 10,1:11:28.76,1:11:30.02,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:30.47,1:11:32.48,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Hang on.
Dialogue: 10,1:11:35.94,1:11:38.40,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,This is our Pokémon Power!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:54.08,1:11:56.96,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Think! Think! Think!
Dialogue: 10,1:11:56.96,1:12:00.42,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’ve got the knowledge... \N I just have to make the gears turn in my head!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:00.42,1:12:03.63,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I have to brainstorm harder \N than anyone ever has!{I have to think harder than \N anyone else in the world!}{Anyone who can make this sound NOT stupid deserves a cookie or three. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:12:05.63,1:12:07.59,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Lum Berries? That’s it!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:08.01,1:12:09.64,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:10.26,1:12:12.31,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is it! This could work!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:12.31,1:12:13.98,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Will you let me have these?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:13.98,1:12:15.60,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I need them to save the city!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:15.60,1:12:16.60,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:17.98,1:12:20.02,Main,Mia,0,0,0,,Hang in there for \N just a little more, Lily...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:21.40,1:12:22.69,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I’m okay...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:22.69,1:12:25.07,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,I know Uncle will save us.
Dialogue: 10,1:12:25.61,1:12:28.37,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I get it. So we gotta get \N the propeller running?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:28.37,1:12:31.41,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Then if we throw \N the doctor’s chemical into it...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:31.41,1:12:33.50,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,That about covers it.
Dialogue: 10,1:12:36.08,1:12:38.00,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Well, that’s not good...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:39.84,1:12:42.88,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,We’ll just have to \N find another route.
Dialogue: 10,1:12:42.88,1:12:44.42,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Huh? No, but...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:44.42,1:12:48.22,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,That’s the old power plant right there, isn’t it? \N It’s right in front of us!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:48.22,1:12:49.64,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,We’ll put out the fire and go on!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:49.64,1:12:52.39,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,No! I won’t allow that \N under any circumstances!
Dialogue: 10,1:12:53.81,1:12:55.18,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,What’s wrong, Granny?
Dialogue: 10,1:12:56.81,1:12:58.10,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,If only...
Dialogue: 10,1:12:58.69,1:13:00.73,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,If only I could have reached \N a little further...
Dialogue: 10,1:13:02.11,1:13:03.86,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Bullu! Come back!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:03.86,1:13:05.28,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Bullu!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:09.87,1:13:11.53,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Come here! Hurry!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:13.83,1:13:16.87,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Bullu!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:19.08,1:13:21.79,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Don’t leave me!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:21.79,1:13:23.96,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Snap out of it, Granny!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:23.96,1:13:27.72,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I don’t know what you’ve been through, \N but we’re here for you now!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:42.61,1:13:44.61,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Thank you, Bullu...
Dialogue: 10,1:13:45.19,1:13:47.57,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,My beloved partner...
Dialogue: 10,1:13:47.57,1:13:50.78,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,...must have protected the key \N for this moment!
Dialogue: 10,1:13:50.78,1:13:52.45,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Now it’s my turn.
Dialogue: 10,1:13:53.62,1:13:56.58,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Will you help me?
Dialogue: 10,1:13:59.25,1:14:03.63,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Let’s show them this \N Pokémon Power thing!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:08.34,1:14:10.68,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Can you help from the sky, too?
Dialogue: 10,1:14:46.04,1:14:50.34,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Right! I’m not sure what just happened, \N but the path is clear!
Dialogue: 10,1:14:59.10,1:15:00.10,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,What do I do...
Dialogue: 10,1:15:00.81,1:15:04.48,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,I’ll never get there if I have to keep \N avoiding the Spores{ほうし}...
Dialogue: 10,1:15:05.19,1:15:06.02,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Sis!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:06.02,1:15:06.65,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Riku?!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:07.07,1:15:08.40,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,I’ll navigate for you.
Dialogue: 10,1:15:08.40,1:15:09.03,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:09.44,1:15:14.07,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,I’m looking for the best route to avoid the smoke \N and get to the Sacred Flame pedestal!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:14.07,1:15:14.74,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Found it!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:14.74,1:15:16.49,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,How did you do that?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:16.49,1:15:19.12,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Actually, how do you even \N know where I am?
Dialogue: 10,1:15:19.12,1:15:20.79,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Just focus on the run!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:20.79,1:15:21.29,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:21.75,1:15:25.04,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Get into the forest in front of you! \N It should slow down the Spores{ほうし} a little!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:25.04,1:15:25.83,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:45.98,1:15:47.36,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:49.73,1:15:50.53,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I thought so!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:55.57,1:15:56.74,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 10,1:15:59.70,1:16:00.70,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’m fine!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:02.00,1:16:04.71,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You hate humans, don’t you?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:04.71,1:16:06.58,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You can’t trust us, can you?
Dialogue: 10,1:16:08.17,1:16:10.92,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,That’s such a sad way to live.
Dialogue: 10,1:16:10.92,1:16:11.88,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 10,1:16:12.92,1:16:14.76,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Let’s be friends!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:18.51,1:16:19.22,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,I’m fine.{Added line. idk, he’s just going “aa” or “un” in response to Poi’s call so I can only imagine it’s meant to be a “Yeah dw about me” thing. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:16:21.68,1:16:23.43,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You bonehead!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:26.19,1:16:28.40,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! 100,000 Volts!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:31.48,1:16:33.57,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu! Iron Tail!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:40.53,1:16:42.29,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Use Lightning Speed!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:55.05,1:16:56.01,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,It’s done!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:56.01,1:16:59.05,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,We did it! It’s finally ready!
Dialogue: 10,1:16:59.05,1:17:02.85,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,Torito! The mayor’s sent \N a car to pick you up!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:02.85,1:17:03.72,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:06.77,1:17:07.89,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Mayor!
Dialogue: 10,1:17:07.89,1:17:10.15,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Everything’s ready.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:10.15,1:17:11.15,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:13.40,1:17:15.11,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,This is countermeasure HQ.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:15.11,1:17:20.74,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,We’ve asked you all to seek shelter due to Fura City \N falling under an outbreak of spore{ほうし} smoke.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:20.74,1:17:24.04,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,If there are any people or \N Pokémon that need help,
Dialogue: 10,1:17:24.04,1:17:27.58,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,we ask that any people nearby \N do whatever they can to assist.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:28.12,1:17:32.67,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,{\q2}Furthermore, we have just dispatched \N a countermeasure team to work on resolving the situation.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:32.67,1:17:37.01,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,They are doing everything in their power \N to ensure your safety as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:39.59,1:17:42.93,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Now, the rest of what I want to say is \N my own request as your mayor.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:42.93,1:17:47.85,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,In addition to the spore{ほうし} smoke outbreak, \N a wildfire is spreading.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:47.85,1:17:50.65,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,In the event that \N the countermeasure team succeeds,
Dialogue: 10,1:17:50.65,1:17:56.32,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I would ask that you all \N help me put out the fire as best you can.
Dialogue: 10,1:17:58.82,1:18:01.45,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,This city has been living a lie \N for too long.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:02.32,1:18:07.95,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,This time, we ourselves, \N along with the Pokémon fighting beside us...
Dialogue: 10,1:18:07.95,1:18:10.58,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,...ought to stand up \N to those flames!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:11.83,1:18:13.92,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,This is crazy...
Dialogue: 10,1:18:13.92,1:18:17.88,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,How on earth are we supposed to \N make this massive thing move without electricity?
Dialogue: 10,1:18:18.84,1:18:20.09,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,With this.
Dialogue: 10,1:18:25.89,1:18:27.35,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Good girl...
Dialogue: 10,1:18:29.39,1:18:30.94,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Okay, seriously?{This line read = PERFECTION. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:18:33.36,1:18:37.36,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,From here on, this will be a battle of endurance! \N I’ll need you all to do your part!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:37.36,1:18:40.03,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You gotta push \N that thing together! Got it?
Dialogue: 10,1:18:40.57,1:18:43.41,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Hey... You mean we gotta \N use brute force, Granny?!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:43.78,1:18:45.83,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,What else do you suggest we use?
Dialogue: 10,1:18:46.33,1:18:47.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 10,1:18:47.62,1:18:49.96,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Now quit dawdling and \N get into position!
Dialogue: 10,1:18:53.42,1:18:56.50,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Here we go! \N All together now...
Dialogue: 10,1:18:56.50,1:18:58.46,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Heave... Ho!
Dialogue: 10,1:19:00.80,1:19:02.97,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Heave, ho!
Dialogue: 10,1:19:03.55,1:19:04.89,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 10,1:19:05.80,1:19:07.64,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 10,1:19:43.68,1:19:46.05,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu, are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,1:19:50.14,1:19:52.81,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora, please stop!
Dialogue: 10,1:19:52.81,1:19:54.56,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You understand, don’t you?
Dialogue: 10,1:19:55.27,1:19:57.36,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Not all humans are bad!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:01.19,1:20:03.15,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Please, believe in us!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:07.95,1:20:08.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:16.00,1:20:16.88,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:47.28,1:20:48.53,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu...
Dialogue: 10,1:20:48.53,1:20:50.99,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Good, everyone’s safe.
Dialogue: 10,1:20:51.41,1:20:53.91,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Come on! \N We were worried about you!
Dialogue: 10,1:20:56.16,1:20:57.33,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Zeraora?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:03.17,1:21:04.42,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:05.38,1:21:06.97,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,We’re friends now!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:08.59,1:21:10.26,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m sorry I kept you waiting!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:10.93,1:21:12.26,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,It’s finished!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:12.26,1:21:13.56,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Wait... Mr. Kagachi{honorific note: Kagachi-san}?
Dialogue: 10,1:21:13.56,1:21:15.18,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Yo, Doctor!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:15.18,1:21:18.14,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Have a look! \N {\i1}I{\i0} got this thing into place!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:18.14,1:21:19.60,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,You must be joking!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:19.60,1:21:21.48,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,It’s {\i1}half{\i0} true.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:21.48,1:21:23.02,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Incredible...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:23.02,1:21:24.90,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This can work! \N I know it can!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:24.90,1:21:28.32,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Now we just have to make sure \N this hits the propellers...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:28.32,1:21:29.95,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Got it. Give it to me!{QUICK NOISES -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:21:30.41,1:21:31.41,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I’ll toss it.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:31.78,1:21:33.54,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,H-Hold on!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:33.54,1:21:35.91,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,You mean you’ll {\i1}throw{\i0} it \N into that thing?!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:35.91,1:21:37.33,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Aren’t there any ladders to...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:37.33,1:21:39.04,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,They’re all gone. \N Burned up in the fire.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:39.04,1:21:40.00,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Oh, no...
Dialogue: 10,1:21:40.50,1:21:43.92,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,We’ve got no time, Doctor. \N This is the only way.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:44.63,1:21:45.67,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I don’t believe this!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:45.67,1:21:48.38,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You all gotta give it \N one more push!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:48.38,1:21:50.34,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Now it’s time to \N spin the propeller!
Dialogue: 10,1:21:50.34,1:21:51.47,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Mr. Kagachi{honorific note: Kagachi-san}.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:51.47,1:21:55.39,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,This is all the chemical we have, \N which my team and I put our all into producing.{Bleh probably a candidate for further rewording. Literally “the one and only chemical” but idk that feels really clunky. It’s like, this one bottle is all they were able to produce. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:21:55.39,1:21:56.68,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 10,1:21:57.27,1:22:00.48,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I swear I’ll get this done, for Lily!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:05.28,1:22:07.57,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Now, give it all you’ve got!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:18.41,1:22:20.33,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Well, this doesn’t look good...
Dialogue: 10,1:22:22.75,1:22:26.38,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,All the debris is gonna \N throw the bottle off course.{Hyper literal: “Even in the event of throwing it, it’ll hit these things before getting to the propeller blades.” -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:22:28.38,1:22:29.84,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You got an idea?
Dialogue: 10,1:22:32.26,1:22:33.22,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Got it!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:38.47,1:22:41.19,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I trust you, partner!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:49.44,1:22:51.65,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Time for one last push!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:51.65,1:22:53.57,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Spin!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:53.57,1:22:55.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 10,1:22:55.62,1:22:57.41,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Spin! Spin!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:10.09,1:23:12.09,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Does this mean...?
Dialogue: 10,1:23:13.09,1:23:14.47,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:17.89,1:23:21.52,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Give me a report on how the citizens \N and Pokémon are doing, stat!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:21.52,1:23:22.14,Main,Oliver's secretary,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:24.06,1:23:25.90,Main,Team Rocket,0,0,0,,{\i1}What a great feeling!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:23:25.90,1:23:27.07,Main,Scientist,0,0,0,,You did it, Torito!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:34.74,1:23:36.70,Main,Lily,0,0,0,,C’mon, look outside!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:39.29,1:23:42.21,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,They did it!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:42.75,1:23:44.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Hey, did ya see that, Doctor?!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:44.62,1:23:47.67,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I did! Amazing! \N You did it on the first try!{I mean, he only HAD one try... -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:23:47.67,1:23:49.21,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,You’re a natural!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:49.21,1:23:51.76,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,I couldn’t have done it \N without Usokki!
Dialogue: 10,1:23:53.30,1:23:56.89,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Don’t celebrate just yet! \N This isn’t over!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:10.61,1:24:12.82,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,The flames aren’t dying down...
Dialogue: 10,1:24:12.82,1:24:16.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Don’t worry! We just have to keep them in check \N until Risa summons Lugia!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:21.83,1:24:23.12,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Those are...
Dialogue: 10,1:24:26.29,1:24:28.17,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Half of you, circle around \N to the other side!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:28.17,1:24:29.42,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Father?!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:30.46,1:24:31.13,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Largo!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:33.01,1:24:34.38,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,It’s Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:34.38,1:24:35.55,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,I’ve never seen it before!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:38.22,1:24:40.10,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,It’s okay, Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:40.10,1:24:42.93,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,This time, they’re trying to \N protect the forest!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:51.11,1:24:52.65,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Everyone, put out the fires!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:53.44,1:24:55.11,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,Satoshi{honorific note: Satoshi-kun}!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:55.61,1:24:56.95,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Everybody!
Dialogue: 10,1:24:56.95,1:24:59.16,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,This is looking dire.
Dialogue: 10,1:24:59.16,1:25:01.03,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Get the sprinklers running!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:01.03,1:25:03.41,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,They should work, \N long as the system hasn’t broken down!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:03.41,1:25:07.08,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’ll go ask the Electric-type \N Pokémon for help!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:07.08,1:25:08.37,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Let’s put an end to this!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:08.75,1:25:10.38,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,All right! We’ll help, too!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:12.67,1:25:17.80,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora, it’s true that there are \N bad people among us, like those hunters...
Dialogue: 10,1:25:17.80,1:25:20.55,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,And we do the wrong thing \N sometimes, too. I get that.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:21.85,1:25:25.73,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,But I want you to know \N that not all of us are bad.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:27.60,1:25:28.94,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Satoshi said...
Dialogue: 10,1:25:29.65,1:25:32.69,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,...that we humans may be \N weak on our own,
Dialogue: 10,1:25:32.69,1:25:35.99,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,but that we’re so much stronger \N with Pokémon by our side.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:37.11,1:25:40.53,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I wonder, doesn’t that \N work both ways?
Dialogue: 10,1:25:40.95,1:25:45.45,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I think it would be nice if \N Pokémon felt the same way.
Dialogue: 10,1:25:54.25,1:25:55.38,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I’m counting on you!
Dialogue: 10,1:25:56.13,1:25:57.72,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Give it your all, guys!
Dialogue: 10,1:26:19.70,1:26:21.86,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,All right... Please, work!
Dialogue: 10,1:26:28.75,1:26:29.91,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 10,1:26:35.80,1:26:37.34,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Satoshi!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:15.92,1:27:17.30,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:17.30,1:27:18.05,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:18.05,1:27:19.21,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,I know you can!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:19.21,1:27:20.59,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:21.17,1:27:22.93,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora...
Dialogue: 10,1:27:26.26,1:27:27.60,Main,Human being,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:28.72,1:27:33.60,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I think it would be nice if \N Pokémon felt the same way.
Dialogue: 10,1:27:43.24,1:27:44.28,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Just a little more...
Dialogue: 10,1:27:50.12,1:27:51.62,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Almost there!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:51.62,1:27:52.29,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:52.29,1:27:53.37,Main,Torito,0,0,0,,You’re so close!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:53.37,1:27:54.25,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,You can do it!
Dialogue: 10,1:27:54.79,1:27:58.46,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,I believe in you, Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:30.16,1:28:31.24,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:31.24,1:28:31.83,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:38.67,1:28:39.54,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:42.00,1:28:43.84,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Zeraora, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:45.55,1:28:46.68,Main,Largo,0,0,0,,Thank goodness!
Dialogue: 10,1:28:56.73,1:28:58.23,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Lugia?
Dialogue: 10,1:29:00.65,1:29:02.90,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Lugia, make the rain fall!
Dialogue: 10,1:29:02.90,1:29:05.53,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,We need you to \N put out the fire! Please!
Dialogue: 10,1:29:25.42,1:29:26.42,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Lugia...
Dialogue: 10,1:29:27.26,1:29:29.76,Main,Kagachi,0,0,0,,Whoa... I got to see it, for real!
Dialogue: 10,1:29:29.76,1:29:32.18,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Risa got the Sacred Flame \N back in time!
Dialogue: 10,1:29:32.18,1:29:33.51,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,The Sacred Flame?
Dialogue: 10,1:29:33.51,1:29:35.06,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,She ran all the way to the pedestal?
Dialogue: 10,1:29:35.06,1:29:38.44,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Yeah! I told her Lugia \N was sure to come!{The dub has him saying that SHE was the one to say this, but... she didn’t though. He left the scene while she was still in full “I can’t possibly do this” mode. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:29:38.44,1:29:41.48,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,You gotta admire that girl’s guts!
Dialogue: 10,1:29:41.48,1:29:46.28,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Zeraora and Lugia \N saved the city once again.
Dialogue: 10,1:29:46.28,1:29:49.49,Main,Hisui,0,0,0,,No, it was {\i1}us{\i0} this time! \N Every last one of us!{While I do really WANT to make this a pseudo- title drop with the “minna”, unfortunately I don’t think there’s any way to do that without it feeling extremely awkward. And even if we HAD kept “Everyone’s Story” as the title, “No, it was everyone this time!” would have also sounded real bad. So... Meh. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:30:28.03,1:30:29.65,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Everyone...
Dialogue: 10,1:30:29.65,1:30:34.24,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,The only reason we were able to \N redo the final day of the Wind Festival...
Dialogue: 10,1:30:34.24,1:30:39.00,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,...was because we had the help of \N every person and Pokémon here.
Dialogue: 10,1:30:39.00,1:30:42.67,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,During the crisis, \N a young boy told me...
Dialogue: 10,1:30:43.08,1:30:46.92,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,...that what we can’t do alone, \N we can do with the help of Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,1:30:47.55,1:30:52.51,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Our citizens, Pokémon, and everyone else \N who helped put out the fire...
Dialogue: 10,1:30:52.51,1:30:54.35,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,...proved this to be true.
Dialogue: 10,1:30:54.76,1:31:00.56,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,I wish to make this a great city \N in which we can live in harmony with Pokémon.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:00.56,1:31:06.44,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,In order to make that happen, \N I hereby abolish the law concealing Zeraora’s existence.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:06.44,1:31:10.32,Main,Oliver,0,0,0,,Moving forward, we will \N coexist with Zeraora!
Dialogue: 10,1:31:33.80,1:31:38.14,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,This planet is filled with \N strange, strange creatures.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:38.14,1:31:43.14,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the skies, in the seas, \N in the forests, in the cities...
Dialogue: 10,1:31:43.56,1:31:47.61,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,You can find them \N all over the world.
Dialogue: 10,1:31:48.36,1:31:52.15,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,We humans and these creatures play together, \N help each other out,
Dialogue: 10,1:31:52.15,1:31:55.78,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,work together, live together...
Dialogue: 10,1:31:55.78,1:31:58.03,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Though sometimes, we may fight...
Dialogue: 10,1:31:58.03,1:32:01.50,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,We live in harmony with them, \N forming many different kinds of bonds.
Dialogue: 10,1:32:03.16,1:32:09.38,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,{\q2}For every last one of these creatures, \N there’s another dream, another adventure waiting!
Dialogue: 10,1:32:10.21,1:32:14.63,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,And they are known as \N Pocket Monsters, or for short...
Dialogue: 10,1:32:14.63,1:32:16.14,Main,Narrator,0,0,0,,Pokémon!
Comment: 10,1:32:23.23,1:32:23.23,Main,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 10,1:36:57.17,1:36:57.17,Main,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 10,1:36:57.79,1:37:01.67,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,And so, Fura City has now \N established a nature preserve!
Dialogue: 10,1:37:04.88,1:37:06.05,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Sis?!
Dialogue: 10,1:37:06.05,1:37:09.34,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,Riku{honorific note: Riku-kun}, tell me how you knew \N where I was and what was going on!{ibasho to ka: “my whereabouts and such”. So how he was fully informed on the entire situation despite not being there. -TLC}
Dialogue: 10,1:37:09.76,1:37:12.10,Main,Risa,0,0,0,,And I want the {\i1}truth!{\i0}
Dialogue: 10,1:37:13.18,1:37:15.06,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,Well, those things{sunglasses} are \N really high-tech, you see...
Dialogue: 10,1:37:15.06,1:37:19.31,Main,Riku,0,0,0,,I kinda wanted footage of \N the Wind Festival... you know?
Dialogue: 10,1:37:22.48,1:37:23.90,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,Pikachu...
Dialogue: 10,1:37:23.90,1:37:26.40,Main,Satoshi,0,0,0,,What kind of Pokémon \N are we gonna meet next?
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,1:32:23.23,1:32:23.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{=45}ED ENGLISH
Dialogue: 4,1:32:31.45,1:32:36.05,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}The charts are filled with positive words
Dialogue: 4,1:32:36.67,1:32:41.39,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Pushing at you more than you care for
Dialogue: 4,1:32:41.93,1:32:46.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}You're working hard enough already
Dialogue: 4,1:32:46.66,1:32:49.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}When suddenly you're rushed,
Dialogue: 4,1:32:49.43,1:32:52.45,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}pressed to change
Dialogue: 4,1:32:52.45,1:32:56.27,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}What's wrong with the status quo?{Should there or should there not be a "the" in here? -TLC}
Dialogue: 4,1:32:56.97,1:33:01.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Is the future gonna leave
Dialogue: 4,1:33:02.90,1:33:06.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}if you don't run for it?
Dialogue: 4,1:33:06.77,1:33:12.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Even your negativity's an important part of you{I feel like this one line might be a tad TOO loose... The literal is "Even negativity is an important piece of you"... Not sure if we ought to tweak this or not. -TLC}
Dialogue: 4,1:33:12.91,1:33:18.20,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}on your grand journey
Dialogue: 4,1:33:18.20,1:33:23.72,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Stay as you are, be true to yourself
Dialogue: 4,1:33:23.72,1:33:28.66,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Your pure voice can echo far
Dialogue: 4,1:33:28.66,1:33:34.13,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}And if you don't let the lyrics
Dialogue: 4,1:33:34.13,1:33:39.65,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}be swapped out for some catchy quotes
Dialogue: 4,1:33:39.65,1:33:45.89,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}and it's no hit, well,
Dialogue: 4,1:33:45.89,1:33:52.14,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1000)\blur6}it's still your song
Dialogue: 4,1:33:54.95,1:33:59.74,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}If the wind blows against you, just turn around
Dialogue: 4,1:33:59.74,1:34:02.46,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Trust the future to be
Dialogue: 4,1:34:02.46,1:34:05.48,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}wherever you look
Dialogue: 4,1:34:05.48,1:34:09.90,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Go at your pace
Dialogue: 4,1:34:09.90,1:34:14.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}The future will be there,
Dialogue: 4,1:34:15.93,1:34:19.83,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}waiting for you
Dialogue: 4,1:34:19.83,1:34:26.04,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}It won't impose upon you,
Dialogue: 4,1:34:26.04,1:34:31.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}nor will it carry you
Dialogue: 4,1:34:31.21,1:34:36.77,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}If some dreams are hard to explain
Dialogue: 4,1:34:36.77,1:34:41.69,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Let them laugh if they don't try to understand
Dialogue: 4,1:34:41.69,1:34:47.19,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}If it's hard to stack up hits now
Dialogue: 4,1:34:47.19,1:34:52.78,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}The charts have their trends and fads, don't worry {Not entirely sure what this line is supposed to say, but it could just be me being tired. - Toa}
Dialogue: 4,1:34:52.78,1:34:58.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Just as you are,
Dialogue: 4,1:34:58.91,1:35:05.88,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1000)\blur6}you can make it so far, far away
Dialogue: 4,1:35:24.25,1:35:29.55,ED,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Kids have the time to take the long way round
Dialogue: 4,1:35:29.55,1:35:34.67,ED,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Age brings the wisdom of knowing the shortcuts
Dialogue: 4,1:35:34.67,1:35:39.62,ED,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}So don't laugh and don't get jealous
Dialogue: 4,1:35:39.62,1:35:44.85,ED,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Both ways are right,
Dialogue: 4,1:35:44.85,1:35:51.19,ED,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}and your road is yours alone
Dialogue: 4,1:35:52.02,1:35:57.67,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}It takes notes and rests to make a melody
Dialogue: 4,1:35:57.67,1:36:02.54,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Nobody can sing a song without pauses to breathe
Dialogue: 4,1:36:02.54,1:36:08.10,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}Just like how sunny days need rainy days,
Dialogue: 4,1:36:08.10,1:36:13.55,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}how every day has a morning and night,
Dialogue: 4,1:36:13.55,1:36:19.81,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}and how travelers repeat
Dialogue: 4,1:36:19.81,1:36:26.18,ED,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur6\t(4135,6137,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}their endless meetings and farewells
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.21,1:36:26.21,ED,,0,0,0,,{=46}
Comment: 0,1:32:23.23,1:32:23.23,Main,,0,0,0,,{=47}ED ROMAJI
Dialogue: 4,1:32:31.45,1:32:36.05,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}positive na kotoba de afureteiru hit chart
Dialogue: 4,1:32:36.67,1:32:41.39,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}tanonde mo nai no ni yatara senaka o osu
Dialogue: 4,1:32:41.93,1:32:46.66,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kimi wa mou juubun ganbatte iru no dakedo
Dialogue: 4,1:32:46.66,1:32:49.43,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}shiranai ma ni sekasareteru
Dialogue: 4,1:32:49.43,1:32:52.45,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}nanika kaero to semarare
Dialogue: 4,1:32:52.45,1:32:56.27,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}ima no mama ja dame kai?
Dialogue: 4,1:32:56.97,1:33:01.66,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}mirai wa hayaashi de nakya
Dialogue: 4,1:33:02.90,1:33:06.77,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}tadoritsukenai mon kai?
Dialogue: 4,1:33:06.77,1:33:12.91,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}negative datte kimi no daiji na kakera
Dialogue: 4,1:33:12.91,1:33:18.20,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}soudai na tabi no tochuu sa
Dialogue: 4,1:33:18.20,1:33:23.72,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}ari no mama kimi no mama de iin janai
Dialogue: 4,1:33:23.72,1:33:28.66,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kakko tsukezu ni koe ni sureba hibiite yuku
Dialogue: 4,1:33:28.66,1:33:34.13,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kiita koto aru you na meigen ni
Dialogue: 4,1:33:34.13,1:33:39.65,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}shiranai aida ni surikawaranai uchi ni
Dialogue: 4,1:33:39.65,1:33:45.89,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}meikyoku ni wa naranakute mo
Dialogue: 4,1:33:45.89,1:33:52.14,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1000)\blur6}tatta hitotsu no your song
Dialogue: 4,1:33:54.95,1:33:59.74,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}mukaikaze wa ushiro mukeba oikaze ni naru
Dialogue: 4,1:33:59.74,1:34:02.46,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}shisen muketa hougaku ni wa
Dialogue: 4,1:34:02.46,1:34:05.48,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}ashita ga aru to shinjiru
Dialogue: 4,1:34:05.48,1:34:09.90,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kibun shidai de yukou
Dialogue: 4,1:34:09.90,1:34:14.78,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}mirai wa tada soko ni atte
Dialogue: 4,1:34:15.93,1:34:19.83,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kimi no koto matteru
Dialogue: 4,1:34:19.83,1:34:26.04,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}komuzukashii jouken tsuketari wa shinai
Dialogue: 4,1:34:26.04,1:34:31.21,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}mukae ni mo konai kedo
Dialogue: 4,1:34:31.21,1:34:36.77,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kantan ni katarun ja nai yume o
Dialogue: 4,1:34:36.77,1:34:41.69,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}wakarou to shinai tanin ga hora waratte iru
Dialogue: 4,1:34:41.69,1:34:47.19,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kantan ni kasanerun ja nai kimi o
Dialogue: 4,1:34:47.19,1:34:52.78,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}sugu ni kawatte yuku hit chart ni nanka
Dialogue: 4,1:34:52.78,1:34:58.91,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}kimi wa kimi no mama de zutto
Dialogue: 4,1:34:58.91,1:35:05.88,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,1000)\blur6}ikun dakara far away
Dialogue: 4,1:35:24.25,1:35:29.55,Kara,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}shounen ni wa toomawari suru jikan ga ataerare
Dialogue: 4,1:35:29.55,1:35:34.67,Kara,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}roujin ni wa chikamichi o shiru chie ga sazukerarete
Dialogue: 4,1:35:34.67,1:35:39.62,Kara,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}dochira ka o warau koto nakare urayamu koto nakare
Dialogue: 4,1:35:39.62,1:35:44.85,Kara,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}sorezore no michi ga aru
Dialogue: 4,1:35:44.85,1:35:51.19,Kara,,0,30,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}dare mo kimi no michi wa yukenai
Dialogue: 4,1:35:52.02,1:35:57.67,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}melody wa onpu to kyuufu ga tsukuru
Dialogue: 4,1:35:57.67,1:36:02.54,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}breath no dekinai uta wa dare mo utai ya shinai
Dialogue: 4,1:36:02.54,1:36:08.10,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}hareta hi mo ame no hi mo aru you ni
Dialogue: 4,1:36:08.10,1:36:13.55,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}asa to yoru ga kyou mo megutteku you ni
Dialogue: 4,1:36:13.55,1:36:19.81,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur6}deai to sayonara kurikaesu
Dialogue: 4,1:36:19.81,1:36:26.18,Kara,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)\blur6\t(4135,6137,\c&H000000&\3c&H000000&)}tabibito no you ni
